ial Deparment \u2018Wayne LaPierre lost his New York appeal, leaving intact a multimillion-dollar repayment \u2018order to the NRA and a 10-year ban from NRA leadership. New Jersey Glock Subpoenas Are Part of Nationwide Push Against America\u2019s Most Popular Pistol New Jersey's Attomey General is demanding Glock sales records from dealers, raising privacy concems and warnings from NRA-ILA and SAF over gun owner doxxing May 2026 NICS Checks Show Gun Demand Rising as NFA Numbers Surge \u2018The May 2026 NICS numbers show a spilt picture: total FBI background checks are down, but NSSF-adjusted checks suggest retail firearm demand is up. Meanwhile, NFA-related \u2018checks for suppressors and short-barreled rifles surged more than 100 percent. PSA Rock Compact: 5.7 Carry Perfected? \u2018The PSA Rock Compact brings 5.7x28mm performance into a smaller, cary-triendly pistol with 21-round capacity, low recoil, optics-ready features, and a reasonable price. AQ RUGER HARRIER\u2019 ae \u201cTL a, \u2018\u201c IT DAILY DEALS (Save 50%)! = s27090 (Coretta 92 Clone) $299.99 Rounds Only 0.26 EA (Save 25%) x18mm Makarov $179.99, \u2018eq. Assembly w Copper Threaded & baroi\u2014si99.90 HARRIER\u00ae IMMENT: EN \u2018Matt in Oklahoma: Change Requires Discomfort And suddenly in NJ uncomfortable didn't it? The ole \u201cIl vote my way and own. Wild Bil: Glocks are just another \u2018option... but welcome to a new author here at Ammoland. | look forward to his insights, Hatmant793: Every year all the non- Glock polymer pistol makers wait with bated breath to find out what new innovations Glock has. Wild Bill: go slaps down one fact, fails, to flesh out his argument, and relies \u2018on help from the entire readership to. Ledesma: Exactly how many innocent soul brothers get clobbered each year by these Glocks? Liberals should do a \"study\"", "ocr_text_len": 3956}
