igh- the Atlantic Council eration with allies onvenin notes US c ABOUT US The Atlantic Council galvanizes US leadership and worldwide \u2018engagement, in collaboration with allies and partners, to shape solutions to global challenges. helps shape a peac pal future. LEARN MORE SPOTLIGHT War with Iran Analysis from Atlantic Council experts in Washington, the Middle East, and around the world on the latest developments in the US- Israeli campaign and what's to come for Iran and the region. SHAPING THE GLOBAL ENERGY FUTURE atlantic Council Forum WASHINGTON, DC * JUNE 9-10, 2026 \u2018A NEW WAY TO STAY INFORMED atiant c Council AC Intel STREAM ANYWHERE YOU GO. FEATURED INTERACTIVE SUPPORT THE ATLANTIC COUNCIL WATCH ACTV PODCASTS ISSUES REGIONS EXPERTS ABOUT DONATE Q. INFLECTION POINTS The US is struggling with its adversaries over the future of Al. Here\u2019s how to win. The Atlantic Council's Commission on Al offers a roadmap to harness the transformative potential of the technology while actively managing its risks READ MORE Atlantic Council Commission on Al lays a roadmap for US leadership in the age of Al How terrorism imperils Pakistan's polio eradication efforts 650+ \u2018STAFF AND FELLOWS WORLDWIDE We generate ideas, foster debates, and leverage innovative approaches to develop practical solutions for \u2018today\u2019s most pressing issues. By building consensus and \u2018mobilizing durable coalitions, we transform ideas into action. THE ATLANTIC IMPERATIVE The Council launched in 1961, just as the Cold War threatened. to turn hot. What Gulf states need ina US-Iran deal Any Strat of Hormuz agreement must establish a framework in which states economically dependent on the waterway help monitor and enforce its terms, How the Iran war is affecting Latin America and the Caribbean\u2019s economic outlook aust sie The data show how eneray and commodity shortages are pushing inflation higher, tightening financial conditions, and slowing growth. Global Energy Forum The 2026 Global Energy Forum will serve as both a reflection on the evolution of the global energy landscape and a forward-looking platform to chart its future based on building systems, strengthening partnerships, and empowering the public. With AC Intel, the Atlantic Council's daily newsletter, you can get exclusive insight on breaking news, in-depth research on the world\u2019s defining challenges, and top moments from our high-level events in your inbox each day. SIGN UP TODAY Atlantic Council Podcasts From the front lines of biodefense and security to the high-stakes world of geoeconomics, our podcasts break down the forces shaping the global future world with unfiltered insights you won't find anywhere else. Trump Tariff Tracker The second Trump administration has embarked on a novel and aggressive tariff policy to address a range of economic and national security concerns. This tracker monitors the evolution of these tariffs and provides expert context on the economic conditions driving their creation\u2014along with their real-world impact. EXPLORE THE DATA Over the past six decades, the Atlantic Council has grown in scope and ambition in ways its founders couldn't have imagined. We recognize that this growth wouldn't be possible without you as a partner, and we are grateful for your generosity to the Atlantic Council. Our work, however, is just getting started\u2014and we need your help to sustain it. If you would like to join us in shaping a better world, please ort our work and donate today.", "ocr_text_len": 3674}
