ell as other special interest groups. We must make the choice not between \u2018left\u2019 and \u2018right\u2019, but between right and wrong.\u201d RICCARDO BOSI Leader of AustrallaOne Party Published Author international Business Consultont Former Australian Army Special Forces Lieutenant Colonel Media and Events ~ Elections Donate ~ Member Portal IT IS TIME FOR AUSTRALIANS TO TAKE BACK THEIR COUNTRY! This needs all of us to take a stand \u2018AustraliaOne is the party for decent everyday Australians who want the best future for themselves, their families, their local communities and Australia One Country, On jople, One Flag AustraliaOne is committed to strengthening Australia as a sovereign, self-reliant, Christian Western Constitutional Republic which is economically powerful, militarily intimidating, politically free, AustraliaOne Party Helpf culturally vibrant, and socially cohesive, Join AustraliaOne \u2018ul Links Let's help each other \u2018AustraliaOne must take back control \u2018of ourlocal councils, as well as our state and federal parliaments. No matter who you are, here's your opportunity Become a Subscriber! Not yet ready to join as a supporter, but you would like to stay informed? Enter your details below to receive our Dispatches (newsletters) Subscribe Authorised by AustraliaOne Party Incorporated - ARBN 653 445 188 - ABN 31 998 206 462 - Baulkham Hills NSW 2153 Australia Copyright \u00a9 2023-2026. All Rights Reserved AustraliaOne Party Inc", "ocr_text_len": 1652}
