ily news service direct to the public. For trusted coverage with no spin or opinion subscribe and download the app. Visit News AAP Newsroom Newsroom is for our wholesale customers to access AAP's journalism and the planning tool Agenda to help power their newsrooms. Newsroom Login 7 We supply news to hundreds of outlets every day , AFL Media, Apple News, The Australian Financial Review, Ballarat Times, The Border Chronicle, Bundaberg Today, The Can Factual. Independent. Impartial. \u2018Combating misinformation and disinformation in our region AAP FactCheck AAP FactCheck is committed to truth and accuracy. Our team of experienced journalists provide rigorous and impartial analysis of misinformation and disinformation circulating online and in the public discourse. Accredited by the International Fact-Checking Network, AAP FactCheck reduces the spread and impact of false information. Explore. heck We capture the moment AAP Photos Media releases trom around the world AAP has one of the most comprehensive archives of Australiat >, with our photo journalists contributing hundreds of new images to it every day across news, sport and daily life. Our image library is accessible to news media, corporate clients and casual users alike. Visit Photos 7 AAP Releases AAPR builds on 90 years of editorial experience with an unrivalled news distribution network and a national newswire that feeds directly into the nation's newsrooms. Explore Press Latest AAP News Get to know AAP News \u00a9 Breaking News \u2018Load of crap\u2019: underworld figure jokes after arrest \u2018Are you looking for AAP Newsroom? Factual. Independent. impartial Data centre boom fails to boot \u00a9 Breaking News \u00a9 Breaking News Anzac Day booer unapologs up lagging economy for disturbing ceremony Follow us", "ocr_text_len": 1923}
