{"_key": "billionbiblesorg", "source_key": "billionbiblesorg", "filename": "BillionBibles.org.png", "image_file": "BillionBibles.org.png", "ok": true, "feature_schema": "nollm_raw12_v3_lx9_v8", "nollm_features": {"s004_sensational_verbs": 0.3704, "s008_neutral_headlines": 0.7407, "s010_scare_quotes": 3.0, "s023_no_owner_identified": 1.0, "s072_loaded_category_tags": 0.0, "s076_conspiracy_tropes": 0.0, "s078_absolutist_framing": 0.0, "s085_standard_sections": 0.0, "s097_suspicious_url": 0.0, "story_block_count": 4.0, "hero_image_area_frac": 0.02955, "thumbnail_size_uniformity": 0.6736, "s060_templated_imagery": 0.0, "largest_face_area_frac": 0.0, "small_face_count": 0.0, "s066_cluttered_blog_look": 0.0448, "inter_story_whitespace_frac": 0.5946, "content_column_count": "3plus", "side_margin_frac": 0.458, "header_band_height_frac": 0.0441, "logo_centered": 1.0, "accent_hue": "green", "accent_color_count": 1.8726, "background_brightness": "white", "s067_alarmist_colors": 0.0104, "page_scroll_length": "short", "nav_item_count": 15.0, "footer_link_count": 28.0, "cta_button_count": 0.0, "newsletter_box_count": 0.0, "social_icon_count": 0.0, "search_box_present": 0.0, "weather_widget_present": 0.0, "account_button_present": 0.0, "category_badge_count": 3.0, "mean_headline_word_count": 3.0, "headline_size_variance": 0.1463, "page_text_density": "medium", "timestamp_count": 0.0, "allcaps_token_frac": 0.0074, "number_token_frac": 0.0335, "city_or_county_in_name": 0.0, "lx_ideology_identity_per100": 1.8519, "lx_attribution_per100": 0.0, "lx_timestamp_per100": 0.0, "lx_loaded_outgroup_per100": 0.0, "lx_health_scare_per100": 0.0, "lx_question_style_per100": 5.9259, "lx_culture_war_per100": 0.0, "lx_market_money_per100": 0.0, "lx_local_civic_per100": 0.0}, "ocr_text": "Christianity and Islam Differences, Similarties and Implications \u2018Sharia Law Quran Home Jesus vs. Muhammad Bible vs. Quran Contact Christianity and Islam 1 aw G Christianity and Islam are the world's two largest religions. The 2.3 billion people who identify themselves \u201cChristian\u201d make Christianity the largest religion. Within the next 30 years, however, Islam's 1.8 billion Muslims are projected to grow faster and surpass the number of Christians, driven by a higher birth rate, currently at 3.1 per Muslim woman. Will Christianity and Islam coexist or collide? Muslims say Islam and Christianity have the same God. Christians say Allah of Islam is not the God of Christianity and ascribe divinity to Jesus, who Muslims say was only a prophet, like Muhammad, who Christians say was not a prophet. Who is right? Presented are the Bible vs. Quran and Jesus vs. Muhammad comparisons, the truth about the Quran, Tagiyya and Halal, and the link between Hijab and Taharrush. Also discussed is the Spread of Islam and Sharia law, including in America and Europe, and Muslim Brotherhood, as well as the Palestinian Issue and \"Islamophobia\" about the \"Religion of Peace.\u201d Comment, questions and content submissions are welcome via the link below. About Us Contact Us Sharia Law Hitler's Islam Stop Islam Muslim Brotherhood Bible vs. Quran Quran Muslims in Germany Jesus vs. Muhammad Naskh Spread of Islam \u2018Prophet\u2019 Muhammad Tagiyya War Against Islam Muhammad's Wives Taharrush Islamophobia Mathematics in Quran Hijab Muslim Refugees No Compulsion Religion Halal Meat Mosque Building Islamberg About Us Religion of Peace? Allah Moon God Contact Palestine Issue West Needs To Know Google BILLIONBIBLES.ORG \u00a92026", "ocr_text_len": 1704}
