{"_key": "billtrack50", "source_key": "billtrack50", "filename": "BillTrack_50.png", "image_file": "BillTrack_50.png", "ok": true, "feature_schema": "nollm_raw12_v3_lx9_v8", "nollm_features": {"s004_sensational_verbs": 0.1934, "s008_neutral_headlines": 1.3427, "s010_scare_quotes": 1.0, "s023_no_owner_identified": 0.0, "s072_loaded_category_tags": 1.0, "s076_conspiracy_tropes": 0.0, "s078_absolutist_framing": 3.0, "s085_standard_sections": 1.0, "s097_suspicious_url": 0.0, "story_block_count": 30.0, "hero_image_area_frac": 0.00628, "thumbnail_size_uniformity": 0.8704, "s060_templated_imagery": 0.5257, "largest_face_area_frac": 0.00057, "small_face_count": 1.0, "s066_cluttered_blog_look": 0.0414, "inter_story_whitespace_frac": 0.1168, "content_column_count": "1", "side_margin_frac": 0.0, "header_band_height_frac": 0.5358, "logo_centered": 1.0, "accent_hue": "blue", "accent_color_count": 1.1255, "background_brightness": "dark", "s067_alarmist_colors": 0.0208, "page_scroll_length": "long", "nav_item_count": 41.0, "footer_link_count": 85.0, "cta_button_count": 1.0, "newsletter_box_count": 0.0, "social_icon_count": 0.0, "search_box_present": 1.0, "weather_widget_present": 0.0, "account_button_present": 0.0, "category_badge_count": 6.0, "mean_headline_word_count": 3.0, "headline_size_variance": 0.2594, "page_text_density": "dense", "timestamp_count": 1.0, "allcaps_token_frac": 0.0058, "number_token_frac": 0.0252, "city_or_county_in_name": 0.0, "lx_ideology_identity_per100": 0.1934, "lx_attribution_per100": 0.0, "lx_timestamp_per100": 0.1934, "lx_loaded_outgroup_per100": 0.0, "lx_health_scare_per100": 0.0, "lx_question_style_per100": 2.3211, "lx_culture_war_per100": 0.0, "lx_market_money_per100": 0.0, "lx_local_civic_per100": 1.5474}, "ocr_text": "BILL TRACK *5O* Your Complete Platform for State and Federal Bill and Regulation Tracking Effortlessly Share Legislative and Regulatory Tracking Data Make your voice heard in the legislative process with easy Al-powered tools designed for professionals and citizens allke. From free and unlimited bill searching to affordable tracking and sharing, consider us your partner in democracy. Forget about time-consuming processes where legislative updates fall through the cracks or costly software that busts your budget. Keep up with the latest developments and promote your cause, allin one powerful platform. Sign up now for a hassle-free, 30-day trial! \u2018Try For Free BillTrack50 Legislation and Regulation Tracking Tools Finding and understanding legislation ishard, so very hard. Let help \u2018you be more efficient and effective. Our robust search engine uncovers state and federal and. ina neat results grid that you can customize and export. Additionally, our bill pages feature Al-generated bill summaries and similar bill suggestions, empowering you with the most relevant information. \u2018Save time and effort on your legislative research so you can focus on other important work. BillTrack50 Mobile Bill eee Tracking Application [= \u2018Stay on top of fast-moving legislative sessions in just a few clicks. Our bill sheets, feature allows you to group, filter, sort, and save ils to simplify Select your alerts to receive dally emails with the information you need to stay informed. \u2018You can also get a separate email reminding you of committee hearings scheduled inthe next 7 days so nothing slips past you. Set up tracking and alerts to never miss an update. Al-Powered Legislation Tracking with BillTrack50 Grab attention and keep your people informed with automatically updated bill lists, maps, and more. Simply drop one of our widgets onto your webpage and we'll keep it full of fresh, relevant, deep content. \u2018Customize the widget's size and appearance, and even color code bills to highlight support or opposition. Site visitors will be eager to click on bills to get more information. Plus, they don't need a BillTrack50 account to access. Scroll down for an example and start engaging! I just want to reiterate how great this site is. Years and years ago, I worked for one of the big state legislative monitoring companies so I understand how hard it can be to track legislation across the states. You have created an excellent system. I am receiving alerts on my bills quickly and with more accuracy than any other site I am using. Thanks again!\u201d NATSAP Megan Stokes Executive Director, The National Association of Therapeutic Schools and Programs Explore the Connective Power of Bill Maps Total Bis: 1,120 Choose astate . \u2018Spark conversation and action in your community with interactive bill maps that share the latest legislative updates 24/7. Bill maps are not only visually appealing, but they're also easy to set up and use. Poke around our example map and discover the engagement possiblities! Try For Free \\Y Solutions For Every Organization Cat Herding in Kentucky When Powerful Legislative Software Feeds a How Our Scorecard Powers Idaho Freedom = Global Regulatory Compliance Business Foundation\u2019s Success July 15,2024", "ocr_text_len": 3237}
