{"_key": "canberradeclaration", "source_key": "canberradeclaration", "filename": "Canberra_Declaration.png", "image_file": "Canberra_Declaration.png", "ok": true, "feature_schema": "nollm_raw12_v3_lx9_v8", "nollm_features": {"s004_sensational_verbs": 0.2088, "s008_neutral_headlines": 0.3212, "s010_scare_quotes": 1.0, "s023_no_owner_identified": 0.0, "s072_loaded_category_tags": 0.0, "s076_conspiracy_tropes": 0.0, "s078_absolutist_framing": 0.0, "s085_standard_sections": 4.0, "s097_suspicious_url": 0.0, "story_block_count": 33.0, "hero_image_area_frac": 0.06056, "thumbnail_size_uniformity": 0.9245, "s060_templated_imagery": 0.0, "largest_face_area_frac": 0.0049, "small_face_count": 24.0, "s066_cluttered_blog_look": 0.0577, "inter_story_whitespace_frac": 0.0401, "content_column_count": "1", "side_margin_frac": 0.0, "header_band_height_frac": 0.5809, "logo_centered": 1.0, "accent_hue": "blue", "accent_color_count": 2.5488, "background_brightness": "offwhite", "s067_alarmist_colors": 0.0769, "page_scroll_length": "medium", "nav_item_count": 13.0, "footer_link_count": 92.0, "cta_button_count": 7.0, "newsletter_box_count": 0.0, "social_icon_count": 0.0, "search_box_present": 0.0, "weather_widget_present": 0.0, "account_button_present": 0.0, "category_badge_count": 6.0, "mean_headline_word_count": 3.0, "headline_size_variance": 0.187, "page_text_density": "medium", "timestamp_count": 0.0, "allcaps_token_frac": 0.1924, "number_token_frac": 0.0106, "city_or_county_in_name": 1.0, "lx_ideology_identity_per100": 5.2192, "lx_attribution_per100": 0.0, "lx_timestamp_per100": 0.0, "lx_loaded_outgroup_per100": 0.0, "lx_health_scare_per100": 0.2088, "lx_question_style_per100": 3.1315, "lx_culture_war_per100": 0.0, "lx_market_money_per100": 0.0, "lx_local_civic_per100": 0.6263}, "ocr_text": "JOINUS v CAMPAIGNS \u00bb DAILY DECLARATION BOOKSHOP v RESOURCES ~ PRAYER \u00bb ABOUT v Stand Up for Aussie Values 7 FAMILY 4 FREEDOM %i: ae FEI ann a fi TAKE ACTION The Canberra Declaration is a diverse network of over 95,000 Aussies who love their country. We share a vision for a better and greater Australia. Together, we are a powerful voice to our federal and state leaders on policies protecting freedom, family, faith, culture and life. Join our national network now to make a difference and have your voice heard for a fair and safe Australia. We defend the vital rights of all Australians to freedom of conscience, freedom of speech and freedom of religion. These freedoms are foundational to an inclusive democracy and are the lifeblood of our nation. We oppose any legislation which effectively denies or limits these freedoms. Protect our freedom and democratic rights. Marriage, as in our Constitution, is the wellspring for our nation\u2019s families. Healthy, happy and loving families are the foundation-stones of our nation. Our children need their families support to succeed and to flourish. Our families are our future. Join us to protect Australian families. Australia is an inclusive society which freely welcomes people from around the world to contribute to our Commonwealth. The Constitution upon which our justice, freedom and prosperity are founded was forged with Christian ideals. Join us to preserve our faith and culture. ~- \u00ab We believe that all human life \u2014 being made in the image of God \u2014 has intrinsic and equal value * from conception to life's natural end. The test of the morality of a society is based on the way it . treats its most vulnerable and innocent - members - including the unborn, the aged and the disabled. > a! Protect human life; sign the Canberra Declaration now. Stand Up for Aussie Values The Canberra Declaration community recognises that our Australian values have been inspired and shaped by Judaeo-Christian ones. But these values are being eroded and attacked and, with it, our quality of life. Countless Australians are not experiencing a \u2018fair go\u2019. That's why we need to make a stand for freedom, family, faith and life. Join the Canberra Declaration and add the power of your voice to a movement fighting for a fair and safe Australia. Take Action SIGN THE DECLARATION DOOOOPVOOO DONATE NOW JOIN US: CAMPAIGNS: NEWS BLOG: RESOURCES: PRAYER: ABOUT US: READ DECLARATION FArTH THE DAILY DECLARATION BREAK THROUGH CONSTANT PRAYER, asout \u2018CONTRIBUTORS. FREEDOM PoDcast (GREAT SOUTHLAND (CURRENT CAMPAIGNS. HistoRY REVIVAL OTHER LANGUAGES Famiuy AuTHoRS PAST CAMPAIGNS, INTERNSHIP MORAVIAN MIRACLE SIGN DECLARATION. ure Bout conract POWER OF PRAYER SHARE DECLARATION FAQ POWER OF THE GOSPEL HeLpus DONATE (CROSS AND CULTURE BEQUESTS THE BLESSING OF THE SPIRIT OF THE MORAVIANS: SUBMISSIONS AUSTRALIAN CHRISTIAN. FREEDOM INDEX VALUES CHECKLIST EASTER REALLY HAPPENED BROCHURE (CHRISTIAN RESURGENCE FACT SHEET Privacy Policy | Terms of Use | Donate Copyright \u00a9 2025 Canberra Declaration | ll Rights Reserved", "ocr_text_len": 3051}
