sur streamlined Learn more \u2018\u00a9 cloud desktops with Nerdio. : = Big Data Al Software Leadership TOP STORIES 1. Trump signs \u00a30 seeking early government access to powerful Al models 2. HPE captures accelerated enterprise demand as revenues soar 3. Nvidia stretches compute power to Windows PCs in support of agents 4, Retailers turn to Al for productivity, personalized shopping 5. Wells Fargo CEO: Al's effect on employment is \u2018complicated\u2019 enterprises deploy the technol Read more> THE LATEST oe nN logy across more parts of the business. Dell revenue jumps 88% as it rides enterprise AI wave \u2018The technology company said enterprises are shoring up from AI workloads rises. @ IT Strategy Why non-production data is becoming enterprises\u2019 biggest compliance blind spot have multiplied the number of places sensitive data lands and the speed at which it gets there, @ Security OpenAI unveils security framework, citing emerging regulations \u2018The Trump administration scrapped a proposed executive order requiring government review of new Al models. But providers still face regulations at the state and international levels @ IT Strategy Cumberland Farms taps Murphy USA tech chief as new CIO Michael Verdesca has held technology-focused leadership positions across convenience retail and restaurants for the past two decades. @ Al Future Tech Salesforce touts Agentforce growth as other segments lag \u2018The company's flagship agentic platform drew in $1 billion in annual recurring revenue, but other categories such as Tableau, fell behind expectations. @ IT Strategy Snowflake targets AI agent adoption with AWS deal, acquisition Google Cloud, Workday team up to launch HR and finance Al agent tools \u2018The companies are working to break down data silos across enterprise software and automate common tasks for HR and finance teams. @ IT Strategy When building an AI strategy, don't forget the humans In tech, all roads lead back to people. Alis no different. @ IT Swotegy Enterprise data is creeping its way into shadow AI tools Executives and employees are clashing over usage policies as AI security concerns rise, an Okta report found. @ ITStotegy Leading AI models are more vulnerable to malicious prompts than vendors claim Hackers could subvert frontier models with attacks that their developers overlook, Cisco said. @ Security Tech titans break revenue records amid deep workforce cuts The largest vendors aggressively reduced headcounts to fund historic levels of infrastructure spending, Omdia analysts found. @ Al& Future Tech Northwest Bank taps banking tech veteran as CIO Chad Ballard, who hails from Wells Fargo, brings 25 years of IT experience in financial services to the Ohio-based bank. @ IT Stotegy Enterprises risk agentic AI failure under \u2018one-size-fits-all\u2019 governance Instead of a binary approach to trust, companies need to assess permissions for each agent and process, Gartner's Shiva Varma said, @ ITSrategy CIOs tackle hybrid roles, blending business outcomes with IT Tech leaders are taking on dual-role mandates as businesses look to consolidate silos and capitalize on AI, according to executive search experts @ ITSrategy How tech chiefs can guide enterprise AI pilots to success Automation needs a champion who is accountable for outcomes and can help engage users. But data and governance can also make or break a project. @ IT Stotegy Amid heavy AI use, workers say their skills are atrophying As worker sentiment sours on the technology, clearer guidelines surrounding its usage may be even more critical @ IT Strategy CISA asks cybersecurity community to alert it to vulnerability exploitation \u2018The agency wants to ensure that its public catalog of actively exploited flaws is as comprehensive as possible. @ IT Stotegy Nvidia revenue jumps 85% on AI infrastructure demand \u2018The company segmented its data center revenue, with half ofits earnings linked to hyperscalers and the other half toa broader customer base, including enterprises. @ IT Strategy ClOs need a people strategy to scale AI @ Al& Future Tech Anthropic unseats OpenAl in the enterprise as AI model spending spikes Claude was the leading large language model for business use last \u2018month, according to the Ramp AI Index. @ IT Srategy Google unveils Gemini 3.5 models focused on agentic work \u2018The AI provider rolled out speedier models that tackle personalized task management as competition for enterprise customers heats up. @ IT Stotegy Liberty Mutual, Travelers discuss when not to modernize Companies must be intentional in selecting which systems to upgrade and when, executives said during the 2026 MIT Sloan CIO Symposium. Get the free newsletter Subscribe to CIO Dive for top news, trends & analysis MOST POPULAR Retailers turn to Al for productivity, personalized shopping F Nvidia stretches compute aud power to Windows PCs in support of agents EIR Wells Fargo CEO: Ars effect on employment is \u2018complicated\u2019 Openal unveils security framework, citing emerging regulations LIBRARY RESOURCES LINE e Top ClO priorities for 2026 \u00a9) Secure & Govern Agentic Al Apps in Real Time E]_ASupportive Ecosystem: How Middlesex County Powers AT COMPANY ANNOUNCEMENTS Actian Launches Agentic Data Steward to Help Maintain Semantic Consistency Across Enterprise A... LINX launches 15-month no-charge initiative to support network community at LINX NoVA Exalate Reaches 15 Years as Integration Becomes Strategic Infrastructure Welo Data Launches Proprietary Platform for Frontier AI Data Production View all | Post a press release WHAT WE'RE READING 1 THE NEW YORK TiMe How One Tech Company Created 13 New Types of Jobs Because of A.I. Blows Alphabet to raise $80 billion from stock sales to fund AI buildout Openal Sued by Florida's Attorney General Over AI Harms (% cw ol EVENTS Toto Launch Res Messaging the Right Way - at Scale 50 Role-Based Learning Pathways for Enterprise AI Adoption View ll | Promote an event INDUSTRY INTEL How Compliance Becomes a Competitive Advantage \u2018The Future of IT Operations: AI That Knows Your Environment and Fixes Problems Implementing and Managing Al \u2018Technology in the Classroom", "ocr_text_len": 6337}
