 a number of factors (new models, high gas prices, mass arrival of Chinese models, etc.), EVs have picked up again in Europe. Close to 385,000 plugin vehicles were registered in Europe in April, 262,000 of them ... [continued] @Eenneen ee NEW! Solar Survey Report 2026 achary Shahan 133 Comments Solar power is being installed faster than any other power source in the world. That's the case in the United States, and that\u2019s the case globally. Solar power is booming. But not all is perfect in the solar industry, not all is sunshine and rainbows. (Sorry for the weak puns.) [continued) Discover more EV charging > EV Charging Stations > Sustainable innovation consulting > Kia EV Sales Rise in USA Zachary Shahan 4 Comments Like its close cousin Hyundai, Kia didn\u2019t get the memo that electric vehicle sales are supposed to be dropping in the United States. In the month of May, the Kia EV6 did see a slight decline year over year, dropping 13% from 801 in May 2025 to 708 in May Iommi) \u00a9 Electric & Plug-In Vehicles Hyundai IONIQ 5 Sales Up 28% in USA! Perhaps all the talk of US EV sales crashing was a bit premature! Or perhaps Hyundai has just decided to buck the trend and go its own way. Welll get much more insight in the coming month when we get more sales data, but, for now, we can say that ... [continued] Waymo Rolls Out the Ojai! \u2018Whours Zachary Shahan 5 Comments It\u2019s been a long time coming, but Waymo is finally rolling out the Ojai, a Zeekr-produced robotaxi model, for passenger trips. It definitely looks more rider-friendly than a typical SUV like the Jaguar I-PACE Waymo has been using. And it\u2019s got a fun, inviting look to it. It does look... [continued] NLT 1 er | ae \u2014 \u2014 Offshore wind projects can bring hundreds of new jobs to their host states, as ilustrated by the Sunrise Wind project in New York (cropped, courtesy of Sunrise Wind) TotalEnergies On The Hot Seat Over Offshore Wind Deal Offshore wind projects can bring hundreds of new jobs to their host states, as illustrated by the Sunrise Wind project in New York. Discover more Electric Vehicles > Gas Prices & Vehicle Fueling > Clean energy reports > The BYD Shark and the DOST Hybrid Electric Train. Photo for CleanTechnica by Reymond Tribdino. A Tale of Two Hybrids The irony of the energy transition is sometimes found not in a showroom, but on a siding track. While putting the BYD Shark through its paces on the dusty backroads of Laguna, | found myself face-to-face with another hybrid machine \u2014 one that predates the Shark by nearly a decade ... [continued] Discover more vehicle > Electric vehicle reviews > Tesla Motors > tercial Vehicle Sales Like what you're ip! reading? atip! Discover more Climate resilience prize Solar energy systems EV Chargers Vewern Elite 300 vw) aczoo. ] \u2018The Only Thing We Sacrificed Was the Size. exp ; Towa ch le Discover more Power Supplies > CleanTechnica analysis reports > EV charging solutions > CleanTechnica Podcasts Breakthrough Solar Appliances = _ oC [Nev News cone DAILY NEWS Newswire Corner Discover more Clean energy news > EV ownership guides > Tesla accessories store > ovens NEW MODEL NOMAD 2 CleanTech NEWSLETTER Discover more Clean technology podcast. > Home solar installation > Autos & Vehicles > GET YOUR CT SWAG TODAY! Check Now > | EE Discover more Batteries > Electric & Plug-in Vehicles > Vehicles > Drop us", "ocr_text_len": 3566}
