onal resource for service members to understand their whistleblower rights if they witness wrongdoing, DOWNLOAD THE GUIDE! SIGN UP FOR THE LATEST WHISTLEBLOWER NEWS CONTRIBUTE TODAY TO MAKE SURE EVERY WHISTLEBLOWER-SVOICE IS HEARD. ABOUT We promote corporate and government accountability by protecting whistleblowers, advanci sccupational free speech, and empowering citizen activists. We educate the public about the importance of whistleblowing and lead campaigns whistleblon protection laws both domestically and internationally. We are a nonpartisan nonprofit, 501{\u00a2)(3) organization, LEARN MORE > EPA BROKE DIOXIN SAMPLING PROTOCOLS IN EAST PALESTINE June Ist, 2026 This week, Government Accountability Project investigators verified through an EPA report that EPA widely used resealable plastic bags to collect and store soil samples for the collection of dioxin samples in East Palestine, Ohio, in the aftermath of the Norfolk Southern train derailment in 2023, Read More > BLOOMBERG LAW: BRAIN DRAIN AFFLICTS DOJ UNIT DEFENDING May 28th, 2026 LATEST NEWS GOVERNMENT ACCOUNTABILITY PROJECT CONDEMNS May 26th, 2026 Government Accountability Project condemns the proposal, which would restrict federal employees from disclosing a sweeping category of \u201cConfidential Government Information\u201d and require those who leave government to obtain an agency official's written permission before speaking. Read More> EL PASO MATTERS: TROUBLED ICE MEDICAL PROVIDER REMAINS AT May 18th, 2026 APPLAUSE FOR REINSTATED FEMA WHISTLEBLOWERS May Ist, 2026 Yesterday, Federal Emergency Management Agency (FEMA) employees who were illegally placed on administrative leave for exercising their First Amendment and whistleblower tights were ordered back to work. On August 25,2025, the employees sent a dissent letter to Congress\u2014The FEMA katrina Declaration\u2014protesting gross waste and mismanagement, abuses of authority, dangers to public health and safety, and violations of laws, rules and regulations by Agency management. Read More > BLOOMBERG LAW: FEMA DOUBTS PERSIST AS MULLIN PUSHES May 12th, 2026 The Justice Department office defending President Donald Trump's immigration agenda has lost roughly a third of its attorneys over the past year, threatening its ability to fend off challenges to the administration's deportation policies. Read More > Camp East Montana's current medical provider has a yearsiong paper trail of oor management and substandard medical care, Read More > Months of upheaval have damaged the Federal Emergency Management Agency beyond swift repair, former officals warn, even as Homeland Security Secretary Markwayne Mullin takes steps to stabilize the agency. Read More > EXPLORE OUR WORK CORPORATE & FINANCIAL ACCOUNTABILITY \u2018The Corporate and Financial Accountability program investigat and litigates corporate whistleblower claims, creates and advocates for anti-corruption legislation, and maintains oversight of private ivities that impact the public interest. ENVIRONMENT, ENERGY & CLIMATE CHANGE \u2018The Environment, Eneray & Climate Change program provides legal representation and support for whistleblowers making disclosures about wrongdoing that impacts the environment and natural resources. Climate Science & Policy Watch defends federal climate. IMMIGRATION Our Immigration campaign represents whistleblowers who help hold our immigration system accountable to the public and to high atalyzing oversight measures and bringing an end to some of the immigration system\u2019s worst abu: a NATIONAL SECURITY (Our National Security program, specializing in Intelligence Community and military whistleblowing, helps whistleblowers make protected disclosures. We also conduct investigations to ensure our national security agencies are working for the public interest. DEMOCRACY PROTECTION INITIATIVE \u2018The Democracy Protection Initiative aims to preserve election integrity through the education and representation of whistleblowers who come forward with information related to the upcoming election. RNMENT ACCOUNTABILITY Our Government Accountability program makes sure that federal, state, and local government whistleblowers are protected every step of the way through investigations, litigation, and advocacy for whistleblowers in the public sphere, INTERNATIONAL WHISTLEBLOWER RIGHTS. ur International Whistleblower Rights program advocates for global whistleblowers by working with activists and governments, drafting laws and policies, representing inter-governmental whistleblowers, offering trainings, and monitoring corporations, v PUBLIC HEALTH Our Public Health program identifies threats to public health and protects whistleblowers who expose corruption and wrongdoing in the public health sector. Our efforts span a wide variety of issues iding food integrity, the phar \u2018eutical industry, and industria.", "ocr_text_len": 4994}
{"_key": "co2coalition", "source_key": "co2coalition", "filename": "Co2_Coalition.png", "image_file": "Co2_Coalition.png", "ok": true, "feature_schema": "nollm_raw12_v3_lx9_v8", "nollm_features": {"s004_sensational_verbs": 0.5435, "s008_neutral_headlines": 0.6898, "s010_scare_quotes": 0.0, "s023_no_owner_identified": 0.0, "s072_loaded_category_tags": 0.0, "s076_conspiracy_tropes": 0.0, "s078_absolutist_framing": 0.0, "s085_standard_sections": 9.0, "s097_suspicious_url": 0.0, "story_block_count": 30.0, "hero_image_area_frac": 0.01227, "thumbnail_size_uniformity": 0.8336, "s060_templated_imagery": 0.0, "largest_face_area_frac": 0.03618, "small_face_count": 0.0, "s066_cluttered_blog_look": 0.0559, "inter_story_whitespace_frac": 0.2642, "content_column_count": "1", "side_margin_frac": 0.0, "header_band_height_frac": 0.0876, "logo_centered": 1.0, "accent_hue": "green", "accent_color_count": 1.6992, "background_brightness": "white", "s067_alarmist_colors": 0.0086, "page_scroll_length": "medium", "nav_item_count": 12.0, "footer_link_count": 56.0, "cta_button_count": 2.0, "newsletter_box_count": 3.0, "social_icon_count": 0.0, "search_box_present": 0.0, "weather_widget_present": 1.0, "account_button_present": 0.0, "category_badge_count": 3.0, "mean_headline_word_count": 3.333, "headline_size_variance": 0.322, "page_text_density": "dense", "timestamp_count": 0.0, "allcaps_token_frac": 0.0396, "number_token_frac": 0.0328, "city_or_county_in_name": 0.0, "lx_ideology_identity_per100": 0.5435, "lx_attribution_per100": 0.0272, "lx_timestamp_per100": 0.0, "lx_loaded_outgroup_per100": 0.0, "lx_health_scare_per100": 0.0, "lx_question_style_per100": 2.9891, "lx_culture_war_per100": 0.0, "lx_market_money_per100": 0.2717, "lx_local_civic_per100": 1.087}, "ocr_text": "News vets _Pubentons timate ue (C02 Learning Center COALITION Providing the Facts About CO: and Climate Change ET THE FACTS: Subscribe to Our Informative Weekly Newsletter Here: About the CO> Coalition The CO2 Coalition is the preeminent scientific organization in the world dedicated to providing facts, resources and analysis about climate change and the vital role carbon dioxide plays in our environment. In carrying out our mission, we seek to strengthen the understanding of the role of science and the scientific process in addressing complex public policy issues. ca) Approaches to policy that do not adhere to the scientific process risk grave damage to the @ economy and to science. Our Members The CO2 Coalition's nearly 200 members contribute their time and considerable expertise in advancing our mission. Our common purpose is to inform people about the science of climate change \u2014 particularly as it relates to the beneficial gas carbon dioxide \u2014 and to correct many misconceptions that have become commonly held beliefs Many of our members are recognized as world experts in their fields of knowledge and possess advanced degrees. These degrees ~ awarded by some of the world's top universities. ~ are in diverse areas of study, including physics, chemistry, biology, ecology, geology, engineering, medicine, meteorology, business and economics. In addition, their credentials Include the Nobel Prize in Physics, as well as membership in prestigious organizations such as the U.S. National Academy of Sciences, Collectively, they have obtained hundreds of patents, published thousands of technical papers, founded companies and provided expert testimony. \u2018As career professionals, they have been professors, physicians, industry leaders registered professional engineers and more ~ all in service of enhancing human understanding and well being, Our Mission We seek to: \u2018+ Present the truth about the benefits of carbon dioxide as a plant food necessary for sustaining all life. \u2018\u00a9 Promote an appreciation of the role of science in addressing complex public policy while adhering rigorously to the scientific method \u2014 a hundreds-year-old approach to research that requires hypotheses be tested by real-world observations and empirical data, \u2018= Reverse the politically driven corruption of science that undermines the education of children and poses grave risks to civilization. What Si \u2018Carbon Dioxide and Climate nce Tells Us Carbon Dioxide (CO) is known as a greenhouse gas because itis one of several gases that have a warming effect on the atmosphere. However, its warming power is small compared to that of the primary greenhouse gas: water in the form of water vapor and clouds. Having even greater influence over long-term climatic changes are solar cycles and variations in the Earth's orbit and axial tit. \u2018The most important role of CO; is that of a plant food that makes life on Earth possible. Currently atmospheric CO2 is near historically low levels, and recent increases from human CO? emissions have been beneficial to both our ecosystems and to humanity. By any scientific measure, CO2 is not a pollutant. The good news is that Earth is greening, plant life is prospering, humanity is flourishing, and climate change is not a crisis. We are a 501(c)(3) non-profit organization, founded in 2015. The CO Coalition is rated as a Four-Star Charity by Charity Navigator (the highest ranking). More than 99% of our donors are individuals and small family foundations. you want to help us continue to provide our message of a prospering planet, please consider making a donation now LEARN MORE CO2 Coalition Media & Publications State and Regional Reports - F Testimonies & Statements - Featured Testimonies & Statements - Festured 723.2028 613.2025, 910.2024 Arkansas & Climate Change: No Physics Demonstrates That Expert Opinion Filed: Hague Warming. No Crisis. No Problem. Increasing Greenhouse Gases Court of Appeals in Shell v. GD Cannot Cause Dangerous Milieudefensie Warming, Extreme Weather or Any Harm \u2018SEE ALL PUBLICATIONS eae Featured In GBM 2i8iingion CLEAR f - etary Times: ENERGY Leadership Media Publications Climate Facts About In the News White Papers Temperature Mission Statement Interviews Climate Issues in Depth CO2 vs Temperature Presentations Science & Policy Briefs Food Security Educational Testimonies & Statements co2 General Member Publications Weather Climate Quiz The Latest CO, The CO2 Coalition was established in 2015 as @ S013) forthe purpose of educating thought leaders, policy \u2018makers, and the public about the important contribution made by carbon dioxide to our lives and the economy. Oovyio DONATE Copyright 2026 -CO2 Coalition - All Rights Reserved Privacy Policy | Terms of Use", "ocr_text_len": 4746}
