t\u2019 - Dems \u2018may not aggressively pursue climate action if they win back power JEU DEZYS QLU-VIIHON CUUTALE prcUge 1S falling dangerously behind We value your privacy \u2018We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalized ads or content, and analyze our traffic. By clicking \u201cAccept All\u201d, you consent to our use of cookies. Customize Reject ail The Climate Scam Is Acknowledged. \u2018Americans Were Fed Lies, & Deserve To Be Compensated. ~ The \u2018Dire Climate Scenario\u2019 scam exposed [oo ne Fey Dim the sun to tackle climate change? Fine by us, public suggests, according to UK government report examining Public attitudes about \u2018solar radiatic modification\u2019 Wrong, Daily Mail, The Thwaites Glacier Isn't About to \u2018COLLAPSE\u2019 No, Climate Central, Summer Warming Isn't Due to Climate Change The EV Mandate Mirage: A Decentralized Reality Check on Supply Chains, Grid Failures & the False Green Promise CANARY CLIMATE WORLD seoreas cues \u2018eNEaRO MRR New Book! \u2018Canary in a Climate World\u2019 36 experts challenge climate \u2018consensus\u2019 ~ Climate Realism vs. the Net Zero Myth launches today The climate change house of cards is finally collapsing SSP5-8.5: Garbage In, Doomcasting Out POLITICO admits UN's worst-case modeling predictions (RCP8.5) were designed to scare nations into climate jigh-emissions scenario was \u00bbwed as an unlikely outlier to help galvanize policymakers to reduce greenhouse gases\u2019 POLITICO: \u2018Trump admin has swept away climate policies\u2019 as Democrats & enviro groups \u2018have gone quiet\u2019 ~ \u2018I's not what the winning issue is right now\u2019 fears reverse cours Scientists predict a global population crash by 2064 ~ with humanity potentially HALVED Bjorn Lomborg: Data vs. Drama: Al Gore's Climate Warnings Twenty Years Later \u2018Reanchor to reality\u2019: UN backflips on climate change scare Risk of snakebites increasing \u2018as a result of climate disruption\u2019, says study ~ WHO predicts hotter climate will lead to more contact between humans & venomous snakes Scientists Take Credit For Averting A Climate \u2018Scenario\u2019 That Was Never Plausible ~ UN IPCC\u2019s RCP8.5 worst- case scenario \u2018did not become implausible because of climate policy\u2019 Meet the new Greta...va Lighthiser! Eva Goliath: The 20-year-old airplane flying climate activist suing Trump for \u2018violating constitutional rights\u2019 - \u2018Young Americans are suing the president for violating rights with executive orders that fuel the climate crisis\u2019 Mainstream media offers misleading framing that \u2018worst-case\u2019 climate model scenario RCP 8.5 \u2018has become implausible\u2019 due to recent renewable energy trends Antarctic Headlines Melt Faster Than the Ice >\u2014N Acne fn fund ye Benth sig ara hati do 4 ol warming gig find pending ke Billionaire funding of climate activism melting! LA Times: \u2018Jeff Bezos\u2019 $10-billion climate pledge is falling dangerously behind\u2019 - Still need to spend more than $7 billion to reach goal \u2014 Plus: Meta \u2018winding down its climate portfolio\u2019 & Bill Gates has trimmed staff at his climate org MARC MORENO Listen: Morano on The Joe Piscopo Show on Trump admins U.S. coal plant push ~'I approve, let's be more like China. The U.S needs to morph into China when it comes to coal production!\u201d ~ \u2018China burns more coal than the rest of the world combined!\u201d \u2018Political Warfare\u2019: REPORT: Billionaire Climate Elitists Pose as MAGA to Eliminate \u2018Enemy\u2019 - \u2018War Plan to Infiltrate Conservative Movement\u2019 ~ Target List Revealed France drops climate from G7 environment talks to appease Trump admin ~ \u2018We chose to focus on less contentious issues\u2019 \u2018This is so ridiculous\u2019 - Watch: Morano on OAN TV talking Claims That Immigration Deportation Flights Are \u2018Accelerating The Climate Crisis\u2019 ~ UK Guardian Claims ICE Deportations Are \u2018Accelerating The Climate Crisis\u2019 - \u2018CO2 Emissions from ICE enforcement flights went up 88% between 2024 & 2025\" NY Times Dances Around UN Scientists Scrapping Trendy Climate Armageddon Scenario The WHO is at it Again: Climate Change Repackaged as a \u2018Health Emergency\u2019 ~ \u2018Dusting off the Covid playbook\u2019 CONFERENT = CLIMATE Ch SBE Watch: Morano\u2019s Keynote speech at DC conference ~ \u2018We're at the lowest point of the climate movement's influence & power in the last 50 years\u2019 - How Trump is Melting Down the Climate Hysteria! - Watch: Morano on Fox in 10-minute long opening segment talks Iran War & Energy, California's nightmare energy, & OC's muddy jar prop Watch: Morano on TV talking UN CLIMATE MODELS RETRACTED: UN thought they could just quietly abandon their extreme predictions, but we're not letting them\u2019 Watch: Morano on The Great America Show talking how Trump admin has crushed climate movement & how gov't should divert money from alarmists to climate skeptic scientists The Electric Vehicle Mandate Mirage: A Decentralized Reality Check on Supply Chains, Grid Failures & the False Green Promise Listen: Morano on Houston's Morning News: \u2018Coal is the most national security-friendly energy source, period\u2019 \u2018With Oil, no matter how much oil the U.S. produces, unless we nationalize our oil industry, we are subject to the global price\u2019 Watch: Greg Gutfeld of Fox News: \u2018The UN is backing off after calling you a climate denier, as if questioning the faulty models is like denying the Holocaust\u2019 ~ \u2018Every apocalypse is a business model. And for the climate change scammers, no business had been hotter than the end of the world\u2019 Why Democrats are abandoning climate-change agenda ~ \u2018Ardent anti- capitalists who once made climate a focus of their agenda are giving the game away by abandoning the cause\u2019 Harrison Ford urges Arizona State graduates to \u2018extend social justice; prevent \u2018mass extinction\u2019 & \u2018climate change\u2019 Analysis: Oil moves our machines, but electricity is the cornerstone of our quality of life Billions have been wasted on UN's climate change lies Listen: Morano on The Joe Piscopo Show talks UN climate panel retreating on doomsday predictions & how Trump made it happen \u201cBeyond reform\u2019: Australian Greens 79- year old co-founder reveals why he quit the party after more than 30 years ~ They became \u2018so captured by this far- left agenda\u2019 with a \u2018lack of free speech, the extremism on gender issues\u2019 EPA Marks 500 Days of Trump Administration with Another 100 Top Environmental Actions Trump directs hundreds of millions of dollars to support coal using emergency powers Trump Announces $700 Million in Actions to Boost U.S. Coal Industry Watch: Trump officially invokes Defense Production Act to save 13 coal plants Meteorologist Joe Bastardi: Climate exaggerators won't go away ~ \u2018Weaponized climate as a tool for control\u2019 NPR fires \u2018climate\u2019 reporters & shutters entire section in latest big media outlet to slash green hysteria coverage UN IPCC Misled The Public For Over A Decade On Emissions - Has backtracked on an apocalyptic scenario, which had assumed burning five times more coal than is known to exist Climate Science Without Its Most Discredited Worst-Case Scenario - The IPCC has retired RCP 8.5 & introduced seven model replacements Brazil to invest $75 million in highway through Amazon, fueling deforestation & climate change concerns Microsoft Pauses Its Carbon Indulgence Spending - Microsoft \u2018was the carbon removal market\u2019 - Climate activists go bonkers, \u2018accuse Microsoft of abandoning its climate commitments\u2019 \"Messaging Misalignment\u2019: Democrats admit climate/green energy hurt them in 2024 election! From the infamous Democrat 2024 postmortem report: \u2018Climate change & green energy transition messaging created anxiety among workers in traditional industries worried about job losses\u2019 New Study: \u2018LGB individuals live in warmer places. ~ Study \u2018tests whether lesbian, gay, & bisexual (LGB) individuals inhabit systematically warmer locations than their heterosexual peers\u2019 Former Time Mag climate reporter Brian Walsh now admits: \u2018The scenario behind the most apocalyptic, attention-getting findings was largely an attempt to imagine how bad things could get, not a true forecast\u2019 - \u2018Climate change's worst-case scenario is officially canceled\u2019 Electricity Markets & Engineering Realities: \u2018tis telling that while [solar & wind] developers routinely claim their energy is now the cheapest available, they never argue that subsidies are therefore no longer needed\u2019 Cal Thomas: \u2018Being wrong means never having to say you're sorry\u2019 ~ UN IPCC changes its climate tune Stossel: How Tom Steyer deployed his billions to stifle climate dissent Professor Who Predicted Mass Human Extinction By 2026 Was Dead Wrong Buffaloed: How a Climate Scientist Was Attacked by the White House, Congress & His Own University ~ Dr. Roger Pielke Jt. reveals how climate dissent is crushed in gov't & academia Conflicts of Interest and Fraudulent Climate Science for Judges Intent is \u2018to bias judges in favor of the climate alarmism stance\u2019 Climate Lawfare Under Counterassault, Finally! ;pport Climate Depot Marc Morano Post 197K 1K 447K cau Mare Morano \u00ae x 3,493 trees clearcut in CA To make way for Inetfectiv, unsafe, non-reeyclale, (robably CCP manufacture), bir-kiling solar panels, by @EmiyT produce aman: Mare Morano \u00ae x \u2018Trump's Withdrawal From UN Climate Bodies EIN J, Mooney Get your copy today! CLIMATE 411 \u2018+ Miliband must publish his secret China energy deal Source: Not a Lot of People Know That | Published on 2026-02-27 \u2018+ Miliband's Blot On The Landscape Source: Not a Lot of People Know That | Published on 2026-02-27 \u2018+ 1.5? An Impossible Dream Source: Not a Lot of People Know That | Published on 2026-02-27 \u2018= CCN\u2019s Climate Bombs Source: Not a Lot of People Know That | Published on 2026-02-27 \u2018+ Almay bring a cognitive renaissance to human thinking \u2018Source: CFACT | Published on 2026-02- a \u2018+ Past storms put climate warriors in their place \u2018Source: CFACT | Published on 2026-02- a \u2018+ Three Times The Cost, Causes Earthquakes-Roll On The Green Power Revolution! Source: Not a Lot of People Know That | Published on 2026-02-26 \u2018+ Cost of Electricity Continues To Rise, Despite Govt Sleight Of Hand Source: Not a Lot of People Know That | Published on 2026-02-26 \u2018= BBC Praise China As Green Superpower Source: Not a Lot of People Know That | Published on 2026-02-26 \u2018+ Trump's good news for our fishing fleet \u2018Source: CFACT | Published on 2026-02- 26 \u2018= SOTU: \u201cThe climate legacy of this \u2018admin can be described as nothing less than triumphant Trump\" Source: CFACT | Published on 2026-02- 25 \u2018+The microreactor race is on \u2018Source: CFACT | Published on 2026-02- 25 \u2018* Ablizzard of climate delusion and deceit \u2018Source: CFACT | Published on 2026-02- 26 \u2018+ We didn\u2019t just get expensive electricity, we built a system that makes it inevitable \u2018Source: CFACT | Published on 2026-02- 25 \u2018+ Trump reopens vast swath of waters off northeastern coast to commercial fishing Source: CFACT | Published on 2026-02- 24", "ocr_text_len": 10930}
