t Friends of the F matters, and what you can do about a ectiN Cookie Notice Cookies and partners to pe our Privacy Policy. About Crooked Media We are a media network that showcases stories, voices, and opportunities for activism that inform, entertain, and inspire action, because it\u2019s up to all of us to do our part to build a better world. Crooked believes that we need a better conversation about politics, culture, and the world around us\u2014one that doesn't just focus on what\u2019s broken, but what we can do to fix it. LATEST EPISODES Affirmative Action for This F*cking Guy: Jared The Splintering MAGA Media Mediocre Men Kushner Rage Machine B Pray episope B PLay episope \u00ae Piay episope Podcasts Browse our shows =\\y with ALEX WAGNER Be What A Day Pod Save America Runaway Country with Offline with Jon Pod Save Th 1613 EPISODES 1128 EPISODES Alex Wagner Favreau \u2018505 EPISODES 31 EPISODES 29 EPISODES Stay Informed, Support Independent Media The midterms will shape everything that comes next, and you deserve analysis you can actually trust. Subscribe to Friends of the Pod for ad free episodes, bonus content, and to help keep Crooked independent and out of Big Tech's pocket Crooked Con Is Back! Join us in Washington, DC on November 5-7, coming out of the midterms and heading into a presidential election. Expect bigger stages, more panels, more incredible speakers, and even more opportunities to connect with people who believe a better America is worth fighting for. Down. Very, Very Down. But Not Out. Vote Save America is committed to doing what we've always done: channel our energy and resources into the biggest fights shaping a better future - and we're not done yet Progressive Values Look Good On You The Crooked Store is your one-stop-shop for merch that helps you shout out your favorite pods, ride for the causes you care about, and connect with other Crooked fans. Whether you're looking for the perfect tee to wear to a protest or a gift for a Hysteria-obsessed friend, you're in the right place. Subscribe to our nightly newsletter. You didn\u2019t scroll all the way down here for nothing. Sponsors Friends of the Pod Contact Careers Articles Archive Terms of Service Privacy", "ocr_text_len": 2412}
