rary volunteer's love of puzzle-solving fueled post-retirement gig \u2018These 911 dispatchers are often the first first, responders in DeKalb County DeKalb content creator showcases local beauty through his camera work By Megann Horstead Clients \u2018kind of become like family\u2019 for this DeKalb volunteering couple + Dispatchers - on the call during people's worst moments - help save lives too + From the Classroom to the Community: Readers Nominate DeKalb County's Everyday Heroes of 2026 Cortland Elementary School librarian shares love of books, learning with students DeKalb County Events Northern Illinois 4 University ee \u2018Adults Calm Puzzling Puzzle Break Storytime MopleParkPublle Library Maple Park Publ Libary 3 4 5 6 7 8 9 10 1 12 13 14 15 16 17 18 Ih School Sports Photos: 2026 IHSA boys track and field state championships By Scott Anderson \u2018Ottawa's Adam Swanson named interstate 8 Baseball MVP . + Wheaton Academy piles on Sycamore early, staves off rally for regional title Huntley tops DeKalb for regional title Pair of Kaneland relays take second at state; Will Rosenow second for Sycamore in shot put Friday Night Drive Mount Carmel DB Tavares Harrington commits to Michigan: \u2018I'm giving them everything I\u2019ve got\u2019 By Russ Hodges + Seneca, Sandwich set to join Illinois Central Eight Conference in 2027-28 \u2018Tyjuan Hagler Foundation continues growth at 18th + St. Patrick DL Davi Folorunsho All throughout DeKalb County, there are people steppin: every day to make our community a better place to live. This is our tribute to Everyday Heroes @ WED THU FRI SAT SUN MON TUE WED THU FRI SAT SUN MON TUE WED THU 19 20 21 Your Team Could Save 20+ Hours a Week. Be the first to know what's happening in your community with Shaw Local newsletters. From breaking news to can't-miss stories, stay informed and connected with news delivered straight to your inbox. GET FREE NEWSLETTERS HERE > SHAW LOCAL Your Team Could Save 20+ Hours a Week. each and Dail