{"_key": "endthefed", "source_key": "endthefed", "filename": "End_the_Fed.png", "image_file": "End_the_Fed.png", "ok": true, "feature_schema": "nollm_raw12_v3_lx9_v8", "nollm_features": {"s004_sensational_verbs": 0.0, "s008_neutral_headlines": 3.2346, "s010_scare_quotes": 2.0, "s023_no_owner_identified": 0.0, "s072_loaded_category_tags": 0.0, "s076_conspiracy_tropes": 0.0, "s078_absolutist_framing": 1.0, "s085_standard_sections": 1.0, "s097_suspicious_url": 0.0, "story_block_count": 0.0, "hero_image_area_frac": 0.0, "thumbnail_size_uniformity": 0.6276, "s060_templated_imagery": 0.0, "largest_face_area_frac": 0.0, "small_face_count": 0.0, "s066_cluttered_blog_look": 0.042, "inter_story_whitespace_frac": 0.0, "content_column_count": "1", "side_margin_frac": 0.0, "header_band_height_frac": 1.0, "logo_centered": 1.0, "accent_hue": "none", "accent_color_count": 0.0, "background_brightness": "dark", "s067_alarmist_colors": 0.0, "page_scroll_length": "short", "nav_item_count": 0.0, "footer_link_count": 2.0, "cta_button_count": 0.0, "newsletter_box_count": 0.0, "social_icon_count": 0.0, "search_box_present": 0.0, "weather_widget_present": 0.0, "account_button_present": 0.0, "category_badge_count": 0.0, "mean_headline_word_count": 6.5, "headline_size_variance": 0.3619, "page_text_density": "medium", "timestamp_count": 0.0, "allcaps_token_frac": 0.1241, "number_token_frac": 0.0138, "city_or_county_in_name": 0.0, "lx_ideology_identity_per100": 2.0548, "lx_attribution_per100": 0.0, "lx_timestamp_per100": 0.0, "lx_loaded_outgroup_per100": 0.0, "lx_health_scare_per100": 0.0, "lx_question_style_per100": 8.9041, "lx_culture_war_per100": 0.0, "lx_market_money_per100": 2.0548, "lx_local_civic_per100": 3.4247}, "ocr_text": "i WHATS THEFED? WHY SHOULD CARE? GETTING INFORMED ENDING THE FED SHOW SUPPORT BLOG WHAT IS THE FED? \u2018The Federal Reserve, \u201cthe Fed\u201d, is the central bank of the United States of America that was created in 1918 by Congress. It is a banking cartel that has a government-granted monopoly on the creation of \u2018money and credit. The Fed literally loans \u201cmoney\u201d (Federal Reserve Notes) into existence. Federal Reserve Notes are paper promises backed by nothing of intrinsic value and they are only functioning as, \u2018money because the government forces them on the public through legal tender laws. Federal Reserve Notes are referred to as dollars but are not. The definition of a dolar is a weight of silver (371 grain). To put it simply, the Fed is a group of banks running a national criminal counterfeiting racket with the protection of the government. CONTACT US", "ocr_text_len": 858}
