{"_key": "energycitizens", "source_key": "energycitizens", "filename": "Energy_Citizens.png", "image_file": "Energy_Citizens.png", "ok": true, "feature_schema": "nollm_raw12_v3_lx9_v8", "nollm_features": {"s004_sensational_verbs": 0.0, "s008_neutral_headlines": 0.4198, "s010_scare_quotes": 1.0, "s023_no_owner_identified": 1.0, "s072_loaded_category_tags": 0.0, "s076_conspiracy_tropes": 0.0, "s078_absolutist_framing": 0.0, "s085_standard_sections": 3.0, "s097_suspicious_url": 0.0, "story_block_count": 23.0, "hero_image_area_frac": 0.04987, "thumbnail_size_uniformity": 0.8002, "s060_templated_imagery": 0.0, "largest_face_area_frac": 0.0016, "small_face_count": 9.0, "s066_cluttered_blog_look": 0.0601, "inter_story_whitespace_frac": 0.2197, "content_column_count": "1", "side_margin_frac": 0.0, "header_band_height_frac": 0.0166, "logo_centered": 0.0, "accent_hue": "blue", "accent_color_count": 1.7725, "background_brightness": "white", "s067_alarmist_colors": 0.0094, "page_scroll_length": "medium", "nav_item_count": 29.0, "footer_link_count": 33.0, "cta_button_count": 1.0, "newsletter_box_count": 0.0, "social_icon_count": 0.0, "search_box_present": 0.0, "weather_widget_present": 0.0, "account_button_present": 0.0, "category_badge_count": 3.0, "mean_headline_word_count": 4.0, "headline_size_variance": 0.3123, "page_text_density": "medium", "timestamp_count": 3.0, "allcaps_token_frac": 0.0177, "number_token_frac": 0.0132, "city_or_county_in_name": 0.0, "lx_ideology_identity_per100": 0.6579, "lx_attribution_per100": 0.0, "lx_timestamp_per100": 0.6579, "lx_loaded_outgroup_per100": 0.0, "lx_health_scare_per100": 0.0, "lx_question_style_per100": 2.4123, "lx_culture_war_per100": 0.0, "lx_market_money_per100": 0.0, "lx_local_civic_per100": 0.2193}, "ocr_text": "@ ENERGY Mission Issues Join Us CITIZENS Energy Citizens. From all 50 States, we come together to make our voices heard. American natural gasidd oll are solving big challenges and bringing us a better tomorrow. See and hear the stories of Energy Citizens just like you. \u2018This website uses cookie When you visit our website, we may deploy digital tracking technologies (such as cookies, pixels, tags, and to as \u201cCookies\") that will allow us and our business partners to collect information from your browser or device, including to provide you with the most relevant information, help us to improve the site's functionality, and for analytics and marketing purposes. This tool allows you to \u2018accept all Cookies, choose the ones you wish to have, or deactivate them altogether (with the exception of necessary cookies, which cannot be deactivated). The choice is yours 4 similar technologies, collectively re ENERGY CMIZENS (Cookiebot Show details > View All Campaigns Thank Your Rep for Protecting Consumers Your Representative voted to support year- round E15 and small refinery exemption reform. This is a win for consumers and gives us all more options at the pump. Issues. ye permit Tell the Senate to pass \u2018ing reform TODAY We know that high energy costs hurt h everyday Americans the most. Energy Citizens should make their voices heard. Browse through the topics and take action today to make a difference in the future of American energy. Together, we can create a brighter energy future for all Gs) CO2 > Access Carbon \u2018Consumer Capture and Choice Storage Benji S. Pennsylvania Enforced mandates are hurting people. Energy Citizens gets the word out! By volunteering with Energy Citizens, | get to meet energetic young people \u2018and do something empowering with them. Industry News LNG Exports Annie C. New Mexico Oil and gas play a vital role in meeting the energy needs of New Mexico and the broader region, ensuring a reliable energy supply. Volunteering with Energy, Citizens allows individuals to engage with their communities, raise awareness about energy-related issues, and educate others about the importance of responsible energy production. Stay informed and chead of the game by checking out some of the latest news in the energy industry. From new technology changing the playing field to big policy shifts, it's important to stay-up-to date on the biggest challenges and opportunities impacting oil and gas today. Read More Industry News @ ENERGY CITIZENS Citizens Like You, Raising Their Vo! StayConnected @ X @ Petroleum 101 Pipeline Safety Davis Penney Oil and natural gas are vit without energy. For us to r do business, we need oil o the cost of running my bu bottom line. \u00a9 2026 Energy Citizens. Paid for by the American Petroleum institute Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy Opt Out of Targeted Advertising", "ocr_text_len": 2832}
