ur latest reports and stories to see the impact we're making together. ESIra NEW: Reform in Power Over the past year, Reform UK has moved from protest party to positions of real authority in local government. In doing so, it has begun to show what its politics. HOPE not hate uses cookies to collect information and give you a more personalised experience on our site. You can find more information in our . To agree to this, please click accept. Researching, Campaigning, and Supporting Communities to build HOPE and oppose far-right extremism. RESEARCH Understanding Hate ACTION Countering Hate COMMUNITIES Building Hope Reports | Publications | News & Blog | Magazine | Podcast Campaigning | Organising | Trade Union Network | Events In Schools | Hopeful Towns | Training Workshops | Resources THE LATEST a1oc A TRAGEDY EXPLOITED: a, ata A Tragedy Exploited: Violence in Southampton after the killing of Henry Nowak 03/06/2026 Raise the Colours: Who are the playground bullies plaguing British streets? 25/05/2026 Objectifying women, peddling conspiracy theories and cal violence: Makerfield Reform candidate's SECOND deleted account exposed 21/05/2026 More Latest News & Blog Content . J STOP REFORM UK\u2019S RISE yj Reform UK is growing faster than anyone expected. We are building a y LEARN MORE YY WATCH: UNDERCOVER: Exposing the Far Right on Channel 4 Missed it live? You can still catch UNDERCOVER: Exposing the Far Right on catch-up. This documentary dives deep into the tactics of the far right and the work we're doing to expose them. Stream it now! WATCH HOW WE WORK HOPE not hate exists to challenge all kinds of extremism and build local communities. Our work focuses on the organised far-right, the communities who are susceptible to them and the issues and policies which give rise to them. STAY INFORMED Are you getting updates from HOPE not hate? Sign up today to stay in the loop and receive the latest news and investigations directly to your inbox. We couldn't do it without ou