201cinfrastructure\u201d bill he keeps bragging about in campaign commercials? \u2018This is what he's bragging about. Justice Jackson Says Ist Amendment Is \u201cHamstringing The Government\u201d In Efforts To Censor Speech Just Founding Fathers intended the Constitution to work. It was designed to restrict the government, not us. Someone should explain to her net only country is in deep shit. e Jackson Says 1st Amendme! Oh, you can thank the 3 moron GOP Senators who voted to confirm her, Mitt Romney (Utah), Susan Collins (Maine), and Lisa Murkowski (Alaska). Hertz CEO Stephen Scherr resigns after EV push goes bust after EV push goes bust. We can\u2019t imagine half your vacation trying to find a charging port, Hertz, one of the four largest car rental companies in the world, is replacing its CEO after the company reversed its bet on electric vehicle (EV) rentals over increasing costs. will step down as Hertz Global Holdings Inc.\u2019s chief rand member of the company\u2019s Board of Directors effective March 31, the company announced Friday. Scherr led Hertz {Jor just over two years after spending nearly three decades at Goldman Sachs. Scherr\u2019s resignation comes as the car rental company struggles with the higher repair costs and low demand for EV rentals. Three KC Men Charged with Illegal Firearms Trafficking, Straw Purchases Related to Investigation of Mass Shooting at Super Bowl Rally ing, Straw Purchases owl Rally. You probably", "ocr_text_len": 3505}
