 arts free the mind for a life of virtue. By educating for liberty, ISI is preparing anew generation of thinkers, We value your privacy INTERCOLLEGIATE Events Video Donate ng\u2019Accept All Reject All Cookieves <i> Epucarionat Mepia Explore the wisdom of the Western tradition. ISI reaches the next generation of leaders and teaches them principles of ordered liberty and virtuous leadership SERIES WESTERN CIVILIZATION ModernAge PROJECT COSMOS es\u201d: \u00b04 BROWSE ALL VIDEOS Our Mission Filling the void left by modern higher education. We inspire college students to discover, embrace, and advance the principles that make America good, free, and prosperous. Reach Reaching the next generation through Teach Forming virtuous leaders through in-person Launch Enabling young conservatives to reach the educational media that explores the Western programs on principled conservatism. commanding heights of American society. tradition. Meet fellow alumni \u2014> Explore educational media > Discover student opportunities \u2014> Sign up for the Intercollegiate Review Newsletter Hear about upcoming ISI events, publications, and media, SIGN UP Now Looking fora community of thoughtful conservatives? America. ISIhas chapters and student newspapers 0} LET'S GET CONNECTED Events Meet and support conservatives who are upholding America's founding vision and the Western tradition. SEE ALL EVENTS 2026 Honors Conference Discourse Explore our latest articles, podcasts, videos, and more. ISI publications and media apply conserva Opportunities Campus CHAPTERS We provide students, faculty, and alumni with financial support and ways to enrich their intellectual journey. Honors PRoGRAM GRADUATE FELLOWSHIPS STUDENT JOURNALISM Facutty Network", "ocr_text_len": 1847}
{"_key": "instituteforhistoricalreviewihr", "source_key": "instituteforhistoricalreviewihr", "filename": "Institute_for_Historical_Review_IHR.png", "image_file": "Institute_for_Historical_Review_IHR.png", "ok": true, "feature_schema": "nollm_raw12_v3_lx9_v8", "nollm_features": {"s004_sensational_verbs": 0.8267, "s008_neutral_headlines": -0.2757, "s010_scare_quotes": 11.0, "s023_no_owner_identified": 0.0, "s072_loaded_category_tags": 0.0, "s076_conspiracy_tropes": 0.0612, "s078_absolutist_framing": 5.0, "s085_standard_sections": 6.0, "s097_suspicious_url": 0.0, "story_block_count": 0.0, "hero_image_area_frac": 0.0, "thumbnail_size_uniformity": 0.8051, "s060_templated_imagery": 0.0, "largest_face_area_frac": 0.00025, "small_face_count": 13.0, "s066_cluttered_blog_look": 0.0464, "inter_story_whitespace_frac": 0.0017, "content_column_count": "2", "side_margin_frac": 0.075, "header_band_height_frac": 0.9998, "logo_centered": 0.0, "accent_hue": "none", "accent_color_count": 0.0, "background_brightness": "white", "s067_alarmist_colors": 0.0018, "page_scroll_length": "very_long", "nav_item_count": 72.0, "footer_link_count": 249.0, "cta_button_count": 1.0, "newsletter_box_count": 2.0, "social_icon_count": 1.0, "search_box_present": 1.0, "weather_widget_present": 0.0, "account_button_present": 0.0, "category_badge_count": 4.0, "mean_headline_word_count": 7.0, "headline_size_variance": 0.1361, "page_text_density": "dense", "timestamp_count": 3.0, "allcaps_token_frac": 0.013, "number_token_frac": 0.0124, "city_or_county_in_name": 1.0, "lx_ideology_identity_per100": 0.7348, "lx_attribution_per100": 0.0122, "lx_timestamp_per100": 0.1837, "lx_loaded_outgroup_per100": 0.2449, "lx_health_scare_per100": 0.0, "lx_question_style_per100": 5.8788, "lx_culture_war_per100": 0.0, "lx_market_money_per100": 0.2449, "lx_local_civic_per100": 0.7961}, "ocr_text": "x@aocxong Search EB Did You Know the IHR is a Nonprofit? \u2018That means our work depends entirely on support from \u2018men and women lke you. Because the Institute is recognized by the IRS as a not- for-profit public interest educational enterprise, your donation is tax-deductible. If you value what the IHR. stands for, now isthe time to show it. sure online donation Join our Mailing List \u2018Several times each week we aistibute by e-mail a timely IHR News and Comment\u201d roundup of news, \u2018analysis and commentary tems. To subscribe, enter your email below: Zionism and the Third Reich Mark Weber A little-known chapter of history is the \\Wide-ranging collaboration between Zionism and Hitler's Third Reich, During the 1930s, Jewish Zionists and German National Socialists shared \u2018similar views on how to deal withthe \"Jewish Question.\u201d \u2018They agreed that Jews and Germans were distinctly different nationalities, and that Jews did not belong in \u2018Germany. During the 1930s no nation did more to substantively further Jewish-Zionist goals than Hitler's Germany, Abraham Lincoln and the Issue of Race Robert Morgan \u2018Many Americans think of Abraham Lincoln, above all, as the president who freed the slaves. immortalized as the \"Great Emancipator,\u201d he is widely regarded as a champion of black freedom who supported social equality of the races, and who fought the American Civil War to free the slaves. While itis true that Lincoln regarded slavery as an evil and harmful institution, it also true, as this paper will show, that he shared the conviction of most Americans of hs time, and of many prominent statesmen before and after him, that blacks could not be assimilated into white society. He rejected the notion of \u2018social equality ofthe races, and held to the view that blacks should be resettled abroad A Straight Look at the Jewish Lobby Mark Weber Jews wield immense power and influence in the United States. The \u2018Jewish lobby\u2019 isa decisive factor in US support for Israel. Jewish-Zionist interests are not identical to American interests. In fact, they often conflict. As long as the \u201cvery powerful\" Jewish lobby remains entrenched, there will bbe no end to the Jewish-Zionist grip on the US political \u2018system and the American media, the Zionist oppression of Palestinians, and the Israel threat to peace. Why I Survived the A-Bomb \u2018Akira Kohchi WETEEREET Hiroshima native Kohchi was a 16- \u2018the ABOMB year-old schoolboy when his city was wees devastated by the first nuclear attack in history. He tells the dramatic, personal - = story of how he experienced and : survived the bombing, and provides a = 2 moving account of his search for his, family through the burning rubble of the doomed city. Then Kohchi recalls how, years later, he forced himself to come to grips with his past and uncover the facts about the bombing and the history the Jed up to it. The author's frankness and humane spirit \u2018make this a first-hand Japanese account of a war crime that dwarfs almost all others. A unique revisionist classic. Praised by the Japan Times newspaper as a \u201cnoteworthy\u201d and \u201cauthentic\u201d personal account, and by Bookwatch newsletter as a \u201cmoving, gripping account.\u201d With full color dust jacket, photos and notes Collusion: Franklin Roosevelt, British Intelligence, and the Secret Campaign to Push the US Into War Mark Weber \u2018Secretive and unlawtul collusion by an Ba 7e%can leader wth a foreign power ESM that subverts the US political process 5 is not new. The most far-reaching and 4 flagrant case was by President Franklin Roosevelt in 1940-41. In the \u2018months before the US formally entered the war in the wake of the Japanese attack on Pearl Harbor, Roosevelt did everything he could to get America into the global confit without actually declaring war. The \u2018cooperation with British inteligence by the President and other high-ranking US officials during that period \u2018was quite ilegal. Such collusion by the nominally neutral US to further the war aims of a foreign government was. contrary to both US law and universally accepted international norms. \u2018The Past Marches On George Morgenstern (1953) ie \u2018Add to these the operations of an organized propaganda capable, apparently, of doping Americans into belief in any myth, and there is P} _ermidabie reason why public opinion =1\u2122 should be so stupefied and stultified that the nation can be led from war to war in pursuit of ever retreating goals. Yet, despite the general numbness, Americans, surveying the results of half a century of intermeddiing, dimly perceive that all is not well Vinnytsia \u2014 The Katyn of Ukraine: A Report by an Eyewitness M. Seleshko With the aid of the civilian population, mass graves had been discovered, in which thousands of corpses had been buried. These \u2018graves were to be opened and the \u2018commission was to establish whom the [Soviet] NKVD had murdered ... The \u2018exhumations in Vinnytsia began on May 25, 1943, and were carried on in three places. The (local] population \u2018was of the opinion that there were around 20,000 victims in the war years ... | had been a soldier in the Ukrainian army during the First World War and had \u2018seen many men killed in battle, but what | had then. \u2018seen can in no way be compared with what | witnessed in that park ... The horror of Vinnytsia I shall never forget, and its doubtful whether ever a Dante would be able to portray the agony that had taken place. Liberating America From Israel Paul Findley Nine-Eleven would not have occurred if the U.S. goverment had refused to help Israel humiliate and destroy Palestinian society. Few express this, conclusion publicly, but many believe it is the truth, | believe the 9/11 catastrophe could have been prevented if any U.S. president in recent decades hhad had the courage and wisdom to suspend all U.S. aid until Israel withdrew from the Arab land seized in the 1967 Arab-Israeli war. The U.S. lobby for Israel is powerful and intimidating, but any determined president could prevail and win overwhelming public support for the suspension of aid by laying these facts before the \u2018American people. YouTube Censors \u2018Restrict\u2019 IHR Videos Institute for Historical Review In line with a recent crackdown policy, YouTube has \u201crestricted\u201d a number of independently produced videos of IHR talks and presentations. To watch a restricted\u201d video, the viewer must frst click through a warning screen. Also, comments on the video are not allowed, and the number of views is not given. Even worse, YouTube wil never \u2018suggest\u2019 a \u201crestricted\u201d video to viewers, which is how many people find our videos. While YouTube claims that its \u201crestriction\u201d policy is \u2018aimed at videos with \u201cinflammatory religious or \u2018supremacist content,\u201d applying it to IHR videos is absurd. YouTube restricts our voice not because we have violated any objective standards, or because we hhave done anything wrong or illegal \u2014 but because it doesn't like what we say. Machinations of the Anti- Defamation League Paul N. (Pete) McCloskey. J. | was in polities fr fteen years, and | think you should start with the assumption: never trust a politician When people finally learn the truth, they turn against those who have been lying to them, \u2018And | think that if the movement of which you people are the cutting edge can retain dispassion in the face of outrages, setbacks and humiliations, the truth can ultimately prevail. You are doing something worse than criticizing the government of the United States; you're threatening the security of the state of Israel. And the Jewish community is dedicated to preserve that state, and to destroy those who speak against it. Good luck! \u2018The Spanish Inquisition and the Jewish Question Brian Chalmers Itis nearly impossible to dig into any chapter of Jewish history without uncovering lessons for our own age. \u2018Spain during the 15th and 16th centuries is a particularly striking \u2018example. Even today, our view of this period, and particularly of the Spanish Inquisition, colors our attitudes regarding relations between Jews and non-Jews. The Inquisition is \u2018considered one of Jewish history's darkest chapters \u2014 and one of Christian history's most shameful Anti-Semitism: Why Does It Exist? And Why Does it Persist? Mark Weber (Over the centuries, rage and hostility against Jews has repeatedly erupted in terrible violence. Again and again, Jews have been driven out of countries where they'd been living. Why does anti-Semitism exist? And why has furious hostility toward Jews broken out, again and again, in the most varied nations, eras and cultures? \u2018Anti-Semitism is not a mysterious \u201cdisease.\u201d As Herzl \u2018and Weizmann suggested, and as history shows, what is often called anti-Semitism is the natural and understandable attitude of people toward a minority with particularst loyalties that wields greatly disproportionate ower for its own interests, rather than for the common \u2018900d. How Hitler Tackled Unemployment Mark Weber To deal with the massive unemployment and economic paralysis, of the Great Depression, both the US Ny and German governments launched innovative and ambitious programs. \u2018Although President Franklin Roosevelt's \"New Deal\u201d \u2018measures helped only marginally, the Third Reich's \u2018much more focused and comprehensive policies proved remarkably effective, Within three years unemployment was banished and Germany's economy was flourishing \u2018And while Roosevelt's record in dealing with the Depression is pretty well known, the remarkable story of how Hitler tackled the crisis is not widely understood or appreciated British WWII Veterans: Unhappy With What's Become of the Country They Fought For F. Roger Devlin \u2018More than once ! have come across the view that if British lads of the 1940s Could have foreseen the state oftheir country today, they would never have bothered to fight the Second World War. Few of those who have heard that view may realize that there is empirical \u2018evidence to support it... The prevailing tone of their letters is one of bittemess over what had become of the", "ocr_text_len": 9990}
