 newsletter for a weekly round-up of bit-sized about Israel, Judaism, and the Jewish experience. JOIN FREE For more than 20 years, ISRAEL21c has celebrated Israeli innovation, culture, and daily life. Now, those stories continue as part of Unpacked, an OpenDor Media brand - trusted by millions for videos, podcasts, and learning resources that make complex topics surprisingly clearer \u2014 and often inspiring. What's new? You'll still find the uplifting, everyday stories you love \u2014 now within a larger ecosystem of smart, engaging, and inspiring content to connect you to Israel, Judaism, and the Jewish experience. Learn more about ISRAEL21c joining OpenDor Media > READ FAQ > EXPLORE ISRAEL21C ARCHIVE > The secret sauce behind America's hit TV _10 Israeli inventions that are changing the _5 things you got wrong about Israelis, shows world MORE VIDEOS > Listen More than a game: Maccabi Tel Aviv, Meet the Israeli Druze The Story Of Israel's Black Panthers Zionism, and Israeli identity MORE PODCASTS > Scroll n Instagram View this post on Instagram View this post on Instagram FOLLOW UNPACKED > Read 24 incredible scientific discoveries made _10 of the best Israeli snacks 10 things you don\u2019t know about Fauda but in 2024 should MORE ARTICLES > Frequently asked questions Why did ISRAEL21c join Unpacked? a To bring even more inspiring Israeli stories to even more people. ISRAEL21c\u2019s legacy of celebrating Israeli life continues as part of Unpacked, alongside videos, podcasts, and resources about Israel, Judaism, and Jewish life. Learn more > Will ISRAEL21c content continue? v Where can | find past ISRAEL21c stories? v | subscribed to ISRAEL21c\u2019s newsletter. What happens now? a What about the Digital Ambassadors program? v IN PARTNERSHIP WITH THE FRIEDKIN FOUNDATION Company _ Information CONTACT US TERMS OF USE MASTHEAD PRIVACY NOTICE ABOUT US SHIPPING & RETURNS WopenDor Media AUTHOR BIOS. COOKIE POLICY PITCH US ACCESSIBILITY CAREERS FOR EDUCATORS Stay in the know and feel smarter about all things Jewish SUBSCRIBE TO THIS WEEK UNPACKED >", "ocr_text_len": 2291}
