Z seus SZ woice TAKEACTION THEWIRE \u2014- NEWS&TOOLS \u00a9 ABOUT = JOINUS-\u2014THE JVP FAMILY [ vonare @ |] | ~ PEACE Join the world's largest Jewish organization supporting Palestine. We're organizing a grassroots, multiracial, cross class, intergenerational movement of U.S. Jews. If you're looking for a political home for Jews on the left in this perilous moment; if you're wanting a Jewish community with justice at the center; if you're looking to turn your anger and grief into meaningful, strategic action: you belong here. JOIN US. Power Half-Hour for Gaza ee Since October 2023, JVP has held a collective, organized space for 30-60 minutes every Monday- Thursday at 3pm ET. In that time, over 11,000 people have come together to channel their grief and outrage into action. All are welcome. All are needed. ASL Interpretation and Closed Captioning provided daily. Power Half-Hour @? for Gaza What's Project Esther? Released quietly in late 2024, Project Esther is \u2018Trump's blueprint to destroy the progressive movement \u2014 planning to defame, defund, and ultimately dismantle groups like JVP within 12-24 months. Read our explainer to find out what's happening, what's next for other issues, and how you can fight back JVP Podcasts VP now offers two podcasts: * Ourclassic Diaspora, which explores the Jewish relationship to Zionism. \u2018+ The just-launched JVP Radio, a member- produced limited series podcast dedicated to stories, strategy, and key questions from JVP leaders, members, and our partners, CALL CONGRESS NOW: FUND PEOPLE, NOT BOMBS. EMAIL CONGRESS: FUND PEOPLE, NOT BOMBS. ACT NOW: THE NEW YORK TIMES MUST ANSWER FOR \u201cSCREAMS WITHOUT WORDS.\u201d S @ a) \u00a9 765,403 83 2.87m 2.37m $60 Members & Supporters Local Organizing Groups Digital Actions Taken Social Media Followers \u2018Average Donation Campaign With Us BREAKS ons LOUISINNA Break the Bonds Louisiana Break the Bonds Miami Break the Bonds", "ocr_text_len": 2086}
