r's Race -- Made Up Numbers Did an Emerson poll show Spencer Prat leading Karen Bass inthe Los Angeles mayors race on May 28, 20267 No, that not rue: Emerson College Poling old Lead Stories \u201cno Such pol exists\u201d {andthe social media post making the claim used \"made up numbers.\u201d The organization last Conducted a poll forthe mayor's race in mid-May, and Bass. 6 May 28,2028 ff by: Saran Thorton Fact Check: Edited Audio Has Fart Sounds NOT In Original Video Of Trump's Return To White House After Arlington Memorial Day Ceremony Does a real video contain \u201cnew auclo\" which reveals President Donald Trump has \"worsening Incontinence\u201d? No, that\u2019 not tue: The audio track of a video was edited to add farting noises and text captioning which are not par of the original video. The altered video was fst published on \u2018TikTok by a joke account where itis no longer publicly, May 28,2028 ff by: Ed Payne Fact Check: FAKE Meme Shows \u2018Epic\u2019 Trump-Obama Exchange About Iran Nuclear Deal -- No Evidence It Happened Does a meme accurately show a real \u201cepic moment\u201d exchange between Trump and Obama about Iran nuclear deals? No, thats nat rue: There is no evidence that such an exchange ever took place (on Social media or anywhere else. Lead Stores found no credible news coverage documenting the alleged incident. The claim appeared in a post archived here) by the. May 28,2028 ff by: Ed Payne :: FAKE Video Shows U.S. Strike on Iranian Drone Carrier IRIS Shahid ~ It Was Created by Al (Does a video show an actual U.S. strike on the Iranian drone carrier IRIS Shahid Bagheri or any Iranian aircraft carrer? No, that's not tre: The cps Al-generated and labeled \u201cMade with Al\u201d An {A detection tool also concluded thatthe video was \u201cIkely Al-generated.\"Adaltionaly, visual and \u2018audio analysis revealed US. fighter jets onthe fight deck and, Fact Check: Armenian Mirror-Spectator Did NOT Produce Report Saying PM Nikol Pashinyan Agreed