 = PROJECTS) VOLUNTEER. 606 SEARCH OUR MISSION There are millions of rural and blue-collar patriotic Americans who are disaffected and disenfranchised from the nation\u2019s corridors of power. Their fears ignored, their priorities dismissed, their values ridiculed, they've become cynical and pessimistic about a government that so often does not hear their voices. ur mission is to register, educate, and enfranchise these disaffected citizens and ensure that their voices are not just heard but heeded and that the American Dream becomes their dream again We will also organize and guide patriotic citizens in lobbying their state legislatures and local governments on America First initiatives like fighting corporate censorship and ensuring voter integrity. You can join our effort by donating, volunteering, and spreading the word about our daunting but necessary endeavor. Click below to learn more about our objectives. MORE ABOUT OUR OBJECTIVES GET EMAIL UPDATES SUBSCRIBE LEADERSHIP Our non-partisan, non-profit organization was created by Matt Braynard who was motivated by President Trump's first inaugural address: \u201cThrough loyalty to our country, we will rediscover loyalty to each other.\u201d Our team\u2019s capabilities in field organizing, data and digital analytics, psychographics, and messaging are an unmatched arsenal that we will deploy on behalf of our objectives. Click below to learn more about our leadership team. NEWS \u2018STH ANNIVERSARY OF Jb AT THE US CAPITOL TUESDAY JANE, 2026 AT NOON FOR MORE INFO GOTO Ses LAA's Braynard on the Matt Gaetz Show \u2018Tuesday, August 19, 2025 at 9:13 PM : Save Our State Last night, Matt Braynard appeared on the Matt LODKAMEADAMERICA.ORE 8 i Success, J6 Committee Gaetz show to ciscuse the mic-decade Sunday, November 23, 2025 at 453 PM redisteting. LAA Announces J6 Sth ; \u2018Some great progress on both the election Read More Anniversary Rally at US Capitol integty font ana Saturday, December 27, 2025 at 4:12AM Read M