e already knew, thanks to incessant reminders, + Adventures in Fat Studies that blacks wore oppressed in centuries past. Now it has beon revealed that despite + Open Tread + More MAGA Monsters in Chicago + Pro Baseball Team Forfets Game After Players Refuse to their ostensibly privileged status, they are oppressed even in modem times. The cffects can be lethal Making fun of Michele Obamas easy and fun, but itis also racist, because sho view vast Joceve black. Therefore, it causes blacks o suffer heart disease, as nephrologst Fita + Moonbats Mate an au of Fisher revealed to former prominent MSNBC anchor Joy id. goo + Calor Home of he Via Daily Caller: Luseatoumeaed + Open Tread + Denied Bal for Wearing When Dr. Frita first saw the viral clip of URC fighter Josh Hockit hen hae shouting, \u201cAnd lastly, Michell Obama is aman! Am right, Ameria?\u201d \u00abUne Ai npose Los ater his match, she told Reid that she was \u201cpersonally humiliated.\u201d decloay + Poti he White House This causes medical symptoms. ett ein hee Wen lt \u201ctok me inmate, Joy tothe data that we have Dr. Fike sid rented \u201cWelteraly have data that sytem racism, chronic discrimination, and omowenun gov ai also public humiliation, we have data that these things inerease Catto cardiavascular negative outcomes.\u201d + Activate Stor B86 Stontinas to Promote Gest They have data. Replacement Cheon + Denver Pule Schoo! Teacher Forced Same Sex Student to \u201cThis s why so many black people and black women specifically have he poorer cardiovascular outcomes when compared to other ethnic groups,\u201d \u00abOpen Td Dr. Fisher continued. \u201cThis is why so many of us have increased strokes. + S15 monn Obtains to Ieactualy real\u201d Lai Mangione + noi DE! Ting Video Depicts Whites as Mosquitoes + Resistance to Mandatory LaBTism Spreads to San Francisco Giants = Open Thread + Obama Presidential Center Debacle Could Hammer Taxpayers \u2018+ Mamdani Throws Money at Propaganda Bureau and Chocolate Condoms + Markwayne Muli Controversialy Wants to Prevent Foreigners From legally Canceling Out Our Votes: Be sure not to laugh; that would be racist and cause heart disea: TOMHATFINGERNEWS Political News Megasite \u2018contact Privacy Statement On atip from Anonymous. SS Fees Poste in Black Oppression | Comments Stes o interest SUBSCRIBE \u201cTranssexual Volence Hall of Europe Is No Longer Free Horrors Posted on June 20, 2028 x We pick up a large percentage of the tab for Europe's defense, fresing up money to finance the lavish welfare states that have drawn so many millions of moochers from the Third World. Supposedly we do this to defend freedom. But having succumbed to moonbattery, is Europe still roo? Not Germany. Via the European Conservative: German director Uwe Bolts latest film about a man who turns to vigilantism after becoming frustrated by rising street crime has been effectively barred from release in Germany. According to Boll, the ban is linked tothe film's portrayal of migrants as perpetrators of serious Crime in Germany is disproportionately committed by migrants. But that's in real life. Fiction must represent the alternate world of the ruling class's suicidal ideology. \u2018Not Italy. Remix News reports what happened when a banner was unfurled that read, \u201cItaly for Italian: \u2018The banner was hung from a window of Liceo Classico Vincenzo Monti \u2018on June 6 by a group of graduating students. Following a police investigation, those responsible were identified and subjected to disciplinary measures by the school\u2019s governing body, Il Giornale reported. Not France. European Conservative reports on the trial of French activist and online commentator Thais d\u2019Escufon: \u2018The case stems from statements she made on BFM TV in 2023, during a discussion about a rape involving an illegal immigrant. d'Escufon, who was herself the victim of a home invasion and sexual assault two years earlier at the hands of a Tunisian migrant, said during the segment that \u201cThe main danger for women is immigrant men, Africans, blacks, and Arabs.\u201d This is indisputably true, which is why she is not allowed to say it DILCRAH (the Interministerial Delegation to Fight Against Racism, Antisemitism, and Anti-LGBT Hate) filed a complaint after that TV appearance, leading to prosecution Prosecutors have requested a sentence of up to one year in prison and a ine of 45,000 euros for \u201cincitement to racial hatred.\u201d The sentence has come down. She wound up with a \u20ac1,000 fine. This is not authorities\u2019 first attempt to shut her up: a Escufon described her six years of activism as marked by media controversy, account suspensions, egal proceedings, and what she sees as systematic efforts to silence dissenting opinions. \u201cFreedom of expression doesn't exist,\u201d she said. \u2018She came to public attention as a spokesperson for G\u00e9n\u00e9ration Identitaire \u2014 which \u2018Macron shut down as a supposed threat to public order because it opposed the Great Replacement. Social media platforms repeatedly suspended her accounts, eventually removing her from Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, and other mainstream networks. D\u00a5Escufon said multiple banks also refused to provide her with banking services, without giving any clear explanations. \u2018There have been previous legal repercussions: \u2018She has already received a six-month suspended prison sentence and a \u20ac3,000 fine in one case, while continuing to pursue appeals through the courts Doosn\u2019t look much like \u2018spunky countermoonbat is ready to throw in the towel: Those in control suppress free speech so as to stall resistance unti it is too late to prevent the demographic displacement ofthe native population. Many rulers have \u2018come to power in Europe over the centuries, but ths isthe frst ruling class to pose an existential throat to European civilization, which will no longer exist when Europe \u2018no longer primarily populated by Europeans. By paying to defend Europe, the USA is helping to destroy it. Rather than provide military defense, it would be more productive to support voices of freedom i Thais d'Escufon's before they are snuffed out. (On tips from abcane. Posted in Gensorsip,mmigraion/Great Replacement |Comments Adventures in Fat Studies Posted on June 20, 2028 Wiliams College biology professor Luana Maroja attended two college-sponsored \u2018events on the topic of the hottest new addition to Cultural Marxism \u2014 fat studios \u2014 and reported back on what she observed via Heterodox STEM. Regarding the first one: \u2018The event opened with identity: the speaker stated that she identified as, \u201cfat, white, and used they/them pronouns.\u201d [learned that \u201cobese,\u201d \u201cBMI,\u201d and \u201cweight\u201d are seen as pejorative terms that should never be used. She \u2018added that it was bigoted to suggest that obesity is mainly a lower- socioeconomic-class issue tied to the inability o afford healthy food. This view, we were told, wrongly assumes that the foods fat people eat are unhealthy and that being fat is bad. Per moonbattery, being fat is not bad, no matter how many years it takes off your life. Saying that itis bad is bad. Body mass index (BMI), she said, was invented to discriminate against \u2018Sat people, and its origins lie in capitalism. White people were blamed for creating the notion that \u201cwhites are thin\u201d as a way of oppressing black people. Medicine was described as another culprit: there is no such thing, \u2018we were told, as a \u201chealthy diet.\" Instead, \u201ca healthy diet is what you like to.eat.\u201d Further, children were deseribed as having an innate ability to sense how much food and what kind of food they need. \u2018Subsisting on a diet of Ho Hos and Lucky Charms is perfectly healthy. To suggest otherwise is to commit the thought crime of fatphobia.. \u2018The speaker reminds us that Cultural Marxism is intersectional, barking: \u201cWhenever we are talking about anti-fatness, we are also talking about white supremacy.\u201d The other event showed just how jrsectional: It was billed as \u201cA conversation on Blackness, Queerness, Gender, Fatness, Disabilities and Their Intersections.\u201d Because the content was somewhat disjointed, will share some direct quotes. We were told that \u201cfatness was invented to prepare individuals \u2018for war by the Nazis\" (though the speaker later added that it was invented by the slave trade). Body faseism is now practiced in France, USA, Israel and Britain.\u201d \u201cThe idea body is militarized to displace and violate black people.\u201d \u201cFat fascism is about the subjugation of the slave and slave-adjacent Palestinians)\u201d \u201cThe Jewish body is imposed on Palestinians by starvation and the denial of junk food [which isthe kind of fod they would like to eat)\u201d \u201cThis subjugation didnot begin with \u2018Trump; it began with democracy and those elected to represent society.\u201d \u2018Mictelle Obama's healthy-lunch initiatives were cited asa pre-Trump example. \u201cFatphobia is the making of the slave.\u201d \u201cFatness has been projected onto African flesh.\u201d You are not men or women; you are just {fat or thin in a ship hold\u201d (referring to slave ships). \"After Nazis, COVID, HIV, [and] slaves, one must prove they are ft and not erippled\u2014thisis how ableism started.\" \u201cNationalists dont believe cripples have the right tocxist\u201d Et cetera This lunacy is not limited to fatuous liberal arts pursuits: Ealitor\u2019s note: As documented in these pages, this postmodern nonsense", "ocr_text_len": 9433}
