tries between July 24-August 2. RIDOH and DEM lift recreational advisory at Worden Pond in South Kingstown \u2018State officials have lifted restrictions on recreational activities at Worden Pond following improved water quality test results showing no toxins present. Residents are reminded to stay. june 18,2 Rhode Island budget includes major investments for Univers of Rhode Island healthcare initiatives \u2018The newly approved Rhode Island state budget provides historic funding increases for University \u2018of Rhode Island initiatives in healthcare education and campus infrastructure, Key measures June 17, 2026 BUSINESS \u2018Twelve Brown University athletes receive CSC Academi District honors \u2018Twelve Brown University athletes have been named to the CSC Academic All District At-Large team for their accomplishments in academics and athletics during 2025-26, The honors span ten, All- June 17,2026 AINews -\u00bb Ocean State Today PAGES CATEGORIES. About \u2018Arts & Entertainment Contact Business _. Government Privacy Policy Schools", "ocr_text_len": 3153}
