e corruption and abuse of power in the federal government. And we promote commonsense reforms that strengthen our democracy and build a more equitable, accountable government. \u2014 OurMission and Values We investigate corruption and abuse of power in our government, exposing systemic problems that endanger our democracy. \u2014 Browse POGO investigates Sand LM in tay Developing solutions. We craft commonsense policy reforms to tackle systemic corruption and abuse of power, protect constitutional rights, and ensure the government works for all people. \u2014 Review ourrecent wins at should familiar Advocating for change. We push policymakers to enact reforms that will strengthen public trust in government. We take our policy proposals straight to those in power, and we empower our supporters to lobby their members of Congress for change. your voice heard Building a healthy democracy. We focus on five core issue areas to ensure our government operates free from corruption and abuse of power, protects our constitutional rights, and addresses injustices. \u2018Accountability The federal government must answer to the people it serves. Anealthy democracy relies on a strong accountability system to ensure the government is working for everyone, We're pushing to \u2018make it easier and safer to expose wrongdoing in the federal government. Read More Exposed problems in military e e family housing. Making an impact. \u2018At POGO, we work strategically to engage Successfully pushed DOJ to enact Policymakers on efforts to reduce corruption and. measures to report on deaths in custody. abuses of power in our government and to ensure leaders are protecting our rights. Trained nearly 400 congressional staff to improve oversight last year. Take Action Become a member of POGO's watchdo: community and make your voice heard. Demand that policymakers enact change now on key government corruption issues. Explore Actions \u2018ction \u2018Action Tell Congress: Close Tell Congress: Stop the The Data Broker Illegal War with Iran Loophole Email Congress. Email Congress i Oversight in your inbox \u2014 \u00a9 Weekly newsletter and updates \u2018Add your email Issues \u2018Our Work About Take Action Donate Accountabilty POGO investigates Mission and Values Other Waysto Give Checks & Balances Reports & Analyses Impact Givil& Human Rights (Civic Engagement and Advocacy History Corruption & Abuse of Power \u2018Testimonies & Public Comments ourre National Secutty Policy Letters & Fact Sheets Projects and Partnerships Congressional Oversight Stat Careers Resources Whistleblower Resources Newsletters. Podcasts Send UsaTip Shop our store Alerts & Updates Bad Watchdog The Bunker The Gontinuous Action The Paper Trail Pentagon Labyrinth The Bridge", "ocr_text_len": 2858}
