el phone number you are Sumvse Moverent Ecucaton fund Message and atartes may poy.Tet | RM HELP or more ntormation Tex sTOPtostoprecevng messages heed WHAT WE WANT OUR DEMANDS ig thousands of young people to win a Green New Deal that will: STOP THE LIMATE CRI \u2014 INVEST IN\u2014 RACIAL Kae WZ REIMAGINE \u2014 \u2014\u2014 AND \u2014 OUR GOVERNMENT ECONOMIC TOBE BY AND FOR JUSTICE ** * THE PEOPLE SEE OUR DEMANDS WHAT WE'RE DOING OUR CAMPAIGNS What we do in the next ten years will determine the course of the next hundred. That's why we are building the people power to take over the country school by school, block by block, city by city, state by state - until we win the vision of our world everywhere. ICE OUT FOR GOOD We are opposing ICE\u2019s occupation of our cities because it is self-defense for democracy, and against the same enemies who are driving us headlong into the climate crisis. There is no path to meaningful climate action in a world where a fossil-fuel bought president like Trump has access to his own personal gestapo. READ MORE PROJECT RISE UP Throughout history and around the globe, students and workers have always led the way to topple authoritarianism , using mass non-cooperation to topple dictators. We\u2019re teaming up with workers and unions to organize against the authoritarian overreach of the Trump administration, and training the muscle of mass cooperation towards larger and larger sustained action. READ MORE GREEN NEW DEAL FOR COMMUNITIES It\u2019s time for a Green New Deal for our communities. Door by door, neighborhood by neighborhood, we will take over our cities and towns to put everyday people in charge and win the homes we deserve. READ MORE SEE ALL CAMPAIGNS. UPDATES SOCIAL MEDIA SUNRISEMVMT We're a movement of young people fighting fascism to win a Green New Deal | Text GND to 88504 fas )weldemana BRE@KING: YoutWVoter Interrupts Governor Beshear At 2026 Obama Gala", "ocr_text_len": 2095}
