{"_key": "therighting", "source_key": "therighting", "filename": "TheRighting.png", "image_file": "TheRighting.png", "ok": true, "feature_schema": "nollm_raw12_v3_lx9_v8", "nollm_features": {"s004_sensational_verbs": 0.9462, "s008_neutral_headlines": -0.6388, "s010_scare_quotes": 9.0, "s023_no_owner_identified": 0.0, "s072_loaded_category_tags": 2.0, "s076_conspiracy_tropes": 0.0, "s078_absolutist_framing": 4.0, "s085_standard_sections": 3.0, "s097_suspicious_url": 0.0, "story_block_count": 3.0, "hero_image_area_frac": 0.0019, "thumbnail_size_uniformity": 0.8972, "s060_templated_imagery": 0.0, "largest_face_area_frac": 0.00113, "small_face_count": 2.0, "s066_cluttered_blog_look": 0.0636, "inter_story_whitespace_frac": 0.3154, "content_column_count": "1", "side_margin_frac": 0.0, "header_band_height_frac": 0.2404, "logo_centered": 1.0, "accent_hue": "blue", "accent_color_count": 1.1621, "background_brightness": "white", "s067_alarmist_colors": 0.005, "page_scroll_length": "medium", "nav_item_count": 0.0, "footer_link_count": 135.0, "cta_button_count": 0.0, "newsletter_box_count": 1.0, "social_icon_count": 0.0, "search_box_present": 0.0, "weather_widget_present": 0.0, "account_button_present": 0.0, "category_badge_count": 3.0, "mean_headline_word_count": 5.571, "headline_size_variance": 0.2245, "page_text_density": "dense", "timestamp_count": 1.0, "allcaps_token_frac": 0.017, "number_token_frac": 0.013, "city_or_county_in_name": 0.0, "lx_ideology_identity_per100": 1.0956, "lx_attribution_per100": 0.1195, "lx_timestamp_per100": 0.0996, "lx_loaded_outgroup_per100": 0.3984, "lx_health_scare_per100": 0.0, "lx_question_style_per100": 4.9801, "lx_culture_war_per100": 2.0916, "lx_market_money_per100": 0.0, "lx_local_civic_per100": 0.3984}, "ocr_text": "Pelley has been redefining awful for CBS since the early days of the George HW. Bush administration. He has been one of the most egregiously biased people in media during all of that time. Like all of the Dem propagandists in American media, Peliey felt that it was his duty to put whatever spin he felt was necessary on a story, all the while trumpeting that he was doing serious journalism @ CBS News Fires \u201c60 Minutes\u201d Blowhard Scott Pelley After He Dumps on Bari Weiss source: Blaze Media Pelley claims that he risked his life for the broadcast and accuses Paramount Skydance of trying to curry favor with the Trump administration. @ Self-Righteous Mutiny at \u201c60 Minutes\u201d Isn't About Saving the Show source: NY Post It's about sabotage and being martyrs for the rotting left. @ Scott Pelley Fired from CBS News After \u201c60 Minutes\u201d Crashout source: NewsBusters \u2018The media hall monitors will likely go into a Chernoby/-level meltdown and go on a multi-day rampage about how the Pelley firing is but the latest attack on free \u2018speech. The \u201cfor-cause\" mid-contract fring certainly anticipates a lawsuit which will draw additional coverage and provide Pelley with a Resistance\u2122 Supernova exit, Likely to Substack. @ Happy Pride Month! America\u2019s 250th Birthday Can Wait source: SteveGruber.com Welcome to June, where LGBTQTIAUVWXYZ-supporting Democrats are busy celebrating every identity imaginable except the shared American identity that made all the others possible. @ What Pride Month Should Be About source: American Thinker Real pride, historically and logically arises from what we build, create, and achieve -- not from what we merely happen to be. @ NPR Plugs Pride Month and Laments That Trump Is Curbing Corporate Donations source: NewsBusters National \"Public\" Radio -- the network that claims to speak for all the American People -- pounced on promoting \"Pride Month\" on Weekend Edition Saturday, lamenting how the Trump administration's drive against wokeness and \u201cinclusion in large corporations is defunding \"Pride\" celebrations. @ Kamala Calls Pride an \u201cOngoing Fight\u201d source: Victory Girls \u2018The \u201congoing fight\u201d to ensure every person could live as their \u201cauthentic self\u201d is \u2018shrouded in inauthenticity and lies. If you are born by divine design, fearfully and wonderfully made in God's very image, the \u201cfight\u201d to be something or someone you are not, and never truly could be, ends in defeat. @ The Democrats\u2019 Mess in Texas source: WND Ken Paxton's opponent is state Rep. James Talarico, afar-leftist. The 39-year-old is a seminarian from the Presbyterian Church USA. That's a shrinking, fully woke denomination whose version of Jesus is Bernie Sanders in a rainbow-colored robe and tiara, \u2018@ The Democratic Mess in Maine source: Townhall \u2018The problem is that Graham Platner's sexting scandal has just broken. People don't really know much about it. There will have to be more news reporting. And then we will see what effect, if any, the scandal has on the polls. At the moment, though, we are seeing polls based on impressions made weeks or months ago. @ Democrats\u2019 Golden Boy Is Already Imploding source: Daily Signal Democrats thought they found their next political golden boy in Maine U.S. Senate candidate Graham Platner, but they realized his campaign follows the same pattern {as disgraced former Rep. Eric Swalwell\u2014with an even worse r\u00e9sum\u00e9. @ Graham Platner Revealed His Repulsive Character 10 Years Ago at His Brother's Wedding source: The Federalist \u2018As his wedding gift to his brother and sister in law, Platner, who was in his early 30s at the time, stripped down to a pair of skimpy running shorts to do an \u2018obnoxious Jack Black-style miming of a Miley Cyrus song \u2014 on the day of the wedding. @ On Voting for Terrible People source: National Review \u2018With the victory of Ken Paxton in the Texas and the bad press about the misbehavior of Graham Plater, a question that has bedeviled our politics since Bil Clinton has resurfaced: how to approach voting when at least one of the major- party candidates is a terrible, immoral person. \u2018@ Meet the Post-Biden Democrats: Biden's Democrats source: American Spectator \u2018The failed president still defines the Democrats\u2019 2028 field. @ Mike Pence\u2019s Misguided Call for Civility source: FrontPage Pence denounces Trump's \u201cabrasive and combative style,\u201d but one of the reasons \u2018Trump has won three presidential elections (yes, three) is that he has turned the Left's own tactics - such as mockery and personal attacks - against them. They aren't used to that from a Republican, and they don't know how to handle it. @ Now Jill Biden Tells Us source: Wall Street Journal Jill Biden is out promoting her new memoir, and as for regrets she doesn\u2019t have a \u2018few. Only one really: In retrospect she wishes her husband hadn't run for a second term, Democrats are furious at this ex post admission, and we can see why. Id diines \u2018Ted Tumer: The Man Who Built the Foundation for the Modern \u2018Media Environment By J. Max Robins \u201cSigns\u201d of the Times: No Kings Protest images from 3-28-26 By Howard Polskin LD. Vance ts Going to Resign as Vice President: Prediction ec] By Randall Rothenberg LEFT-LEANING MEDIA Sites That Keep Us Sane \u2018American Crisis Civil Discourse with Joyce Vance Courier Newsroom Mediaite Media Matters Mother Jones Notes from an American Status News Talking Points Memo. The Atlantic The Contrarian \u2018The Don Lemon Show \u2018The Warning with Steve Schmidt EXCLUSIVE RESEARCH Traffic Reports Top 20 Podcast Subjects POPULAR TOPICS Assassination Biden California CharlieKirk College Debate DEI Democrats GavinNewsom ICE iran. Kamala Kamala Harris Los Angeles Mamdani Media tariffs Transgender \u2018Trump Woke What Is TheRighting? \u2018TheRighting is a news outlet geared mainly for mainstreamers and progressives who are interested in the viewpoints of right-wing \u2018media. We feature a website and a free daily e-newsletter. Every weekday since 2017, \u2018TheRighting publishes more than a dozen headlines from conservative news sources as well as a short summary by President and Founder Howard Polskin. TheRighting Alerting Mainstream Audiences to Today's Headlines from the Right eft-Leaning Media Guide Right Wing Media Guide \u2018About TheRighting Letters to TheRghting Privacy Policy cOXS emalladdress\u201d +]", "ocr_text_len": 6265}
