{"_key": "thelastrefuge", "source_key": "thelastrefuge", "filename": "The_Last_Refuge.png", "image_file": "The_Last_Refuge.png", "ok": true, "feature_schema": "nollm_raw12_v3_lx9_v8", "nollm_features": {"s004_sensational_verbs": 0.2609, "s008_neutral_headlines": 0.4244, "s010_scare_quotes": 5.0, "s023_no_owner_identified": 0.0, "s072_loaded_category_tags": 0.0, "s076_conspiracy_tropes": 0.0, "s078_absolutist_framing": 2.0, "s085_standard_sections": 3.0, "s097_suspicious_url": 0.0, "story_block_count": 12.0, "hero_image_area_frac": 0.01432, "thumbnail_size_uniformity": 0.7661, "s060_templated_imagery": 0.0735, "largest_face_area_frac": 0.00571, "small_face_count": 5.0, "s066_cluttered_blog_look": 0.0599, "inter_story_whitespace_frac": 0.433, "content_column_count": "3plus", "side_margin_frac": 0.182, "header_band_height_frac": 0.0038, "logo_centered": 0.0, "accent_hue": "orange", "accent_color_count": 1.4722, "background_brightness": "white", "s067_alarmist_colors": 0.0318, "page_scroll_length": "long", "nav_item_count": 55.0, "footer_link_count": 107.0, "cta_button_count": 1.0, "newsletter_box_count": 0.0, "social_icon_count": 1.0, "search_box_present": 0.0, "weather_widget_present": 0.0, "account_button_present": 0.0, "category_badge_count": 6.0, "mean_headline_word_count": 4.4, "headline_size_variance": 0.3477, "page_text_density": "dense", "timestamp_count": 12.0, "allcaps_token_frac": 0.0721, "number_token_frac": 0.0572, "city_or_county_in_name": 1.0, "lx_ideology_identity_per100": 0.2609, "lx_attribution_per100": 0.0, "lx_timestamp_per100": 1.0435, "lx_loaded_outgroup_per100": 0.0, "lx_health_scare_per100": 0.0, "lx_question_style_per100": 3.2174, "lx_culture_war_per100": 1.5652, "lx_market_money_per100": 0.087, "lx_local_civic_per100": 0.7826}, "ocr_text": "UGE BAS 74S 2unce oF SAY HELLO: j= CONSERVATIVE MISFITS \u2018TheLastRefuge@xeag: TRANS JWENEED YOU To BE ANDREW BRemanT, 1AM ANDR 0; ser Vout TBE fo BRENBARI: HOME ABOUT E-MAILGUIDELINES COMMENTGUIDELINES ADVERTISING PRIVACY Pulte Factor \u2014 Quick Reference Guide to Media Leaks \u2014\u2014 praverrequests \u2014\u2014 June20,2026 | Sundance | Leavea comment With Acting DNI Bill Pulte coming into office, several people have requested my simple guide to identifying media leaks. - \u2018This reference resource is based on historic patterns and generally has an 80/20 accuracy rate. While there are some leaks that cross through the data pattern, in the aggregate this \u2014 SUPPORT THE TREEHOUSE \u2014 i basic outline has shown to be correct. Donate \u2018The leak source identification can help interested political, aa \\ observers understand the motives and objectives. \u2018When you see the term \u201cexclusive\u201d in the originating media - Support The Treehous report, this guide increases in accuracy: $5 $10 $15. Other + The State Department leaks to CNN + The CIA leaks to The Washington Post undefined + The DOJ/FBI leaks to The New York Times and Politico \u2014\u2014 Apverrisement \u2014 + DHS domestically leaks to the Wall Street Journal + The National Security Council leaks primarily to Axios and Politico, NYT secondary + The Pentagon leaks to Fox News and the Wall Street Journal (Axios more recent) + Kash Patel leaks to John Solomon \u2014 Just The News + \"DNI leaks to the Wall Street Journal, however: Click here for e-mail The ODNI gets little complicated due tothe structure of the ODNI. Each intelligence agency has a liaison delivery! office inside the Office of the Director of National Intelligence. Generally, the topline guide above overlays delivery with the desk assignment. EMAIL SIGN-UP ADVERTISMENT Example 1: CNN gets an \u2018exclusive\u2019 leak related to the DNI; the leak sourcing is therefore most likely to be the State Dept Desk inside the DNI office. (State Dept leaks to CNN) \u2014\u2014\u2014 carecories Example 2: Washington Post gets an \u2018exclusive\u2019 leak related to the DNI. The leak sourcing is directly from the CIA liaison desk inside DNI. (CIA leaks to WaPo) Select Category \u2018This is the consistent pattern that established itself over the past 20 years. It is generally accurate on an 80/20 basis. Meaning 80% of the time the origin of the leak can be identified this way with accuracy; 20% of the time itis not \u2014\u2014 RECENT comments \u2014 Betsy jones on Saturday june 20th Hope that helps. =Open Thread remembergoliad on President \u2018Typical Brog Behavior, Uncategorized, USA \u2018= Open Thread Lulu on lune 20th = 2026 ADVERTISEMENT Presidential Polit Trump \u2018Administration Day 517 scruffyeon on ne 20th = 2026 Presidential Poli June 20th - 2026 Presidential Politics - Trump Sebel Administration Day 517 \u2014\u2014 ADVERTISEMENT June 20,2026 | Sundance | 331 Comments Inan effort to keep the Daily Open Thread a little more open topic we are going to start anew RECENT POSTS daily thread for \u201cPresidential Politics\u201d. Please use this thread to post anything relating to the Pulte Factor \u2014 Quick Reference Donald Trump Administration and Presidency. Guide to Media Leaks june 20, 2026 June 200h lites Trump Administra Day 517 June 20, 2026 Saturday june 20th = Open Thread June 20, 2026 President Trump Notes Opposition Effort to Destroy DC Reflection ool june 20,2026 President \u2018Trump Unveils the New \u2018One June 19,2026 President Trump Axis Interview =\"The Elements of Power June 19, 2026 HISTORICAL CAMPFIRE \u2018CONVERSATIONS, Select Month \u2014\u2014 THe sri Hour \u2018This thread will refresh daily and appear above the Open Discussion Thread. (more..) Posted in Uncategorized ADVERTISEMENT \u2018Be still, and know that lam Saturday June 20th - Open Thread God: tu anda that am June 20,2026 | Sundance | 181. Comments Our Father, who art in heaven, hallowed be thy Name. Thy kingdom come. THY WILL BE DONE, on \u2014 AbverrisemenT \u2014 \u2018arth as itis in heaven. Give us this day our daily bread. And forgive us our trespasses, as we forgive those who trespass against us. And lead us not i temptation, but DELIVER US FROM EVIL. For Thine is the kingdom and the power and the glory, forever and ever. Amen t (more..) Posted in Uncategorized ADVERTISEMENT President Trump Notes Opposition Effort to Destroy DC Reflection Pool June 20, 2026 | Sundance | 189 Comments \u2018Team Algae and Filth has been busy at work, supported by CNN, ABC and various leftist media, in an attempt to grow algae back in the DC reflection pool, and cut out the newly installed lining, A few arrests have been made by DC park police. Yes, these folks are that unstable. Liberalism is. a mental disorder. President Trump responds to the effort via \u2018Truth Social \u201cWe've cleaned, renovated, and beautified over 45 \u2018Monuments and Memorials, 28 Statues, and 22 Fountains in Washington, DC. Things are really looking good in our Nation's Capital, and add to that the fact that when I became President, Crime \u2018was rampant, and now, Washington, DC, is one of the Safest Cities anywhere inthe United States. However, we've had some real problems with Vandalism at the beautiful Reflecting Pool, which sits between The Washington Monument and The Lincoln Memorial. Just like three days ago, they destroyed the grass \u2018outside of the Pool, they've also done everything possible to hurt the inside surface that was just installed. No different than the chemicals that \u2018were used on the National Mall, they used something similar in the Reflecting Pool to try to destroy and demean our beautiful work. Lightweight ABC Reporter Jonathan Karl, was seen sticking his hand into the Pool, and trying to rip the rubber off ofthe surface. The algae is 75% gone, and the condition will soon be completely remedied, and the area that was vandalized, fortunately, is just a small \u2018area of damage, and will be fixed early next week. I'sa shame that the Radical Left Lunatics, most likely \u2018Dumocats, who have spent their lives trying to ruin our Country, are free to do so. Law Enforcement is actively investigating this situation and will hopefully have it resolved soon. Thank you for your attention to this matter!\u201d ~ DONALD J. TRUMP, PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES OF AMERICA jovernment, Freedom 250, med President Trump Unveils the New Air Force One June 19,2026 | Sundance | 12L.Comments President Donald Trump unveils the new Air Force One airliner which will carry all US. Presidents around the globe. President Trump Axios Interview - The Elements of Power June 19,2026 | Sundance | 65 Comments President Donald \u2018Trump gives an extensive interview to Axios on current events, the comparison between \u2018Term 1 and Term 2, and the issues surrounding the ceasefire agreement with Iran. \u2018The conversation centers on Iran, where Trump defends the military campaign, the deal that followed and his decision to stop short of further escalation. He also discusses the Strait of Hormue, Israel and Benjamin Netanyahu, Cuba, Venezuela, artificial intelligence, Anthropic, China's Al race and how he thinks about \u2018maintaining power in the final stretch of his presidency. CHAPTERS: 0:00 \u2014 Welcome to The Axios Show", "ocr_text_len": 7067}
