ect accelerates a just transition to a regenerative economy. We fund and amplify climate justice solutions created by Black, Indigenous, immigrant, women and communities of color building an equitable world. Together with our grantee partners we are creating a future where everyone has access to clean energy and air, safe drinking water, affordable housing, healthy foods, and good green jobs. Learn More About The Solutions Project \u2014> What if we told you the solutions to the climate ci exist in frontline commu: all across the U.S.? The Solutions Project believes we must invest in the ideas of everyday heroes from the communities most impacted by climate change. Their solutions make our lives better and create a fairer, healthier, and more equitable society. Each of us has a part to play to scale community solutions, shift culture, and drive change. Your donation makes it possible for more frontline communities to advance equitable climate solutions. Together, we can create the future \u2018we want and everyone deserves. Le \u2018n About Our Impact \u2014> It's time to invest in grassroots leaders That's exactly what we're doing. Our grantmaking and narrative programs are disrupting the status quo of philanthropy and supporting frontline community organizing. Learn About Our Grantees \u2014> EXPLORE | Climate Justice Solutions Narrative Shift Meet Our Grantees i Storybank j \u2018We're proud to share our latest This report from The Solutions Since 2015, we've invested more This climate justice solutions impact report, which shows. Project examines the U.S. than $50M in grants to over 300 storybank is a hub that what's possible when frontline narrative landscape for climate groups across 45 states through showcases how people are \u2018communities lead the way on Justice communications ~> \u2018our core grantmaking and the currently building power, creating climate justice. > movement ecosystem funds we change and delivering administer. > transformative results. >