 Pride Month! We've compiled teaching materials to address issues of equality, inclusiveness, mutual understanding and acceptance. What's new All about SBOs \u2018SBO season is upon us. View new, pre- approved and other sample SBO ballots, UFT guidance and learn more about the process. UFT Tier 6 Rally Log in | Sign up We are family UFT members and their households are invited to a fun-filled day of music, activities, raffles and delicious food on June 6. Don't miss this chance to connect, celebrate and create lasting memories! Puerto Rican Day Parade Celebrate Puerto Rican pride, solidarity and culture with the UFT at this year's National Puerto Rican Day Parade on June 14! \u2018Some 4,000 UFT members were joined by thousands of other unionists from across New York State as they packed MVP Arena in Albany on a \u2018Sunday to rally lawmakers to \u201cFix Tier 6.\u201d Members demanded that state legislators lower to 55 the age at which Tier 6 members with 30 years of service can retire without penalty. The March 8 rally culminated months of \u201c6\u201d days actions by UFT members to make the need to Fix Tier 6 \u201cvisible; human,\u201d and \u201cloud.\u201d UFT members waved poms-poms, held signs and cheered loudly during the March 8 rally, making it clear that Tier 6 must be fixed, and it must be fixed no\\ Paraprofessional Jasminie Jones of P4 @ 179, a District 75 program in Queens, is all fired up to Fix Tier 6 during the rally in Albany. Jonathan Fickies Union Rights and Benefits wA Health Benefits UFT members are entitled to premium-free health insurance. Learn more\u00bb Green hexagon with dollar st UFT members earn pay increases based on experience thanks to the bargaining power of the Salary Learn more\u00bb Orange hexagon with symbol}, piggy bank and dollar sign Pension Adefined-benefit pension will provide guaranteed monthly payments from the day you retire union. for the rest of your life. Learn more\u00bb symbol Contracts Through the strength of collective bargaining, the union has negotiated contracts that protect the rights ofits members. Learn more\u00bb Join the union! \u2018Asaunion member, you'll have access to valuable benefits and gain a voice in your professional life. Enroll now \u00a9 UFT staff member on phone Contact Us Get in touch with a UFT department or representative. Learn more\u00bb More for Members \u00a9 Two UFT chapter leaders looking at piece of paper Chapter Leaders Get the information and tools you need as a union representative. Learn more\u00bb \u00a9 Two new UFT members holding UFT stuff New Members Welcome! Learn about the rights, benefits and resources your union provides. Learn more\u00bb \u00a9 Ask George icon - member hub Ask George Our Member Hub guide is available 24/7 to provide answers to common questions. Aska question\u00bb a UFT App UFT Mobile App \u2018Anew mobile app has been launched for \u2018members to connect with us and access important information. Download the app\u00bb a UFT Member Hub UFT Member Hub The Member Hub has personalized content, services and resources you need as a UFT member. Goto the Member Hub \u00bb Red hexagon with seal of approval Participate rB Bronx Quick Links Health Benefits School Calendar az UFT ay Cone! Join UFT Brooklyn Salary Events Contact Manhattan Pension UFT Safety Incident Report UFT Member Hub Queens Advertise Staten Island Copyright\u00a9 1999-2026 United Federation of Teachers Contact Press Releases PrivacyPolicy Termsofuse", "ocr_text_len": 3505}
