nd our food supply is decimated. People are not getting flu shots. The sheep are not... SPIKE PROTEINS 02092025 Cryptocurrency: The Spike Harvesting Program Introduction Quite obviously, crypto is a spike harvesting program, meaning pice spies (up and down) ae designed to manipulate you (through excitement and fear) and thereby harvest your assets. Covid vaccination was also a... VACCINE-OTHER 2672005 Throwback Thursday: Justice for David Daleiden. Take That Kamala Harris! After nine long years, i is finally over. California has dropped all \u2018charges against David Daleiden, founder of the Center for Medical Progress, and journalist Sandra Merritt. The two agreed to a \u201cno- contest\u201d plea deal... FEDERAL FUNDING FREEZE Nc Kicking Butt and Taking Names: Trump Puts NIH On Notice [NIH has canceled scientific meetings in the face of Trump's funding freeze. Egads, what will we do? You could almost hear the uproar from the JH FUNDING,USAID 02/01/2005. academic research community, not to mention the thousands of bureaucrats. mee THE ACT oyswams Throwback Thursday: \u201cUnavoidably Unsafe\u201d Vaccines \u2018The dog and pony show at RFK Jr's confirmation hearing yesterday \u2018was BEYOND ABSURD, and Congress will dish out round 2 later today. Elizabeth Warren (D-MA) was even more unhinged than usual. Surely Liz knows... ovmams The Compromised FDA Knows Exactly What It's Doing \u2018The sneaky bastards at the FDA did this a year ago, right under our noses. In January 2024, the FDA finalized a rule permitting Institutional Review Boards (IRBs) to waive or even alter informed consent... VACCINE OTHER o1y0ns Throwback Thursday: Dr. Peter Daszak finally pays the price for gain of function research. Lest we forget... Its DONE! EcoHfealth Alliance and its former President Dr. Peter Daszak have been formally debarred for five years by the Congressional COVID Select Committee. Daszak facilitated in-of-function research in Wuhan, China. This. \"TRANSHUMANISM. o1/17/2025 Technofascism Update: Humanity\u2019s Battle at the Crossroads of Al and Nanotech Can you believe all ofthe information bubbling to the surface? Folks, buckle up. Things will continue to be exposed in our world, and no rugs will be left to sweep shit under. Those who. \"THROWBACK THURSDAY 01/162005 Throwback Thursday: Is The Government Spraying Us With Bacteria? \u201cMany of us experienced the strange dense fog in late December. In fact, this fog seemed to cover haf the US, especially the southeast. In \u2018Naples, Florida, a man there who experienced this fog also. DNA PROFILES, DNA TESTING, GENETIC TESTING 01/122025 23AndMe: What Happens To Your DNA If The Company Goes Bankrupt? It sounds really great, doesn't it? There's such an easy way to learn about your long lost great grandfather who was a fisherman in \u2018Newfoundland. It's easy to do \u2014 just swab the inside of... ESOS UTE BY a THES JON EMAIL CONTACTUS DONATE TO DR.T \u2018SFE BODY DETOX ~CLCK ON IMAGE TO LEARN MORE \u2018The Tenpenny Report (formerly Vaxxter) is a site that promotes alternative health news. It offers \u2018well-structured and highly referenced articles of interest on vaccines and pharmaceutical products. Much Ado About Measles Cryptocurrency: The Spike Harvesting Program Throwback Thursday: Justice for David Daleiden. Take That Kamala Harris Kicking Butt and Taking james: Trump Puts NIH On Notice Throwback Thursday: \u201cUnavoidably Unsafe\u201d Vaccines \u2018This website is for informational purposes only. We do not treat, cure, diagnose or otherwise help ailments. Before attempting any natural or holistic practices, itis strongly encouraged that you seek professional medical advice from a licensed healthcare professional. Any communication with Dr. Sherri Tenpenny through this site is for informational purposes only and does not constitute the establishment of a doctor-patient relationship. \u2018Any posts you have made about your private matters and personal health are in the public domain and therefore, are not private. Please post responsibly. Please read our Privacy Policy Select Category 7", "ocr_text_len": 4251}
