wyer Julian Nicholls disclosed that they intend to present 60 to 70 witnesses against Duterte, including around 31 insider witnesses who. (V) FACT CHECK: NO P8K cash aid, food allowance for senior citizens, clip is AI-GENERATED \u2018Two Facebook pages are circulating a video claiming that senior citizens will receive P8,000 in monthly financial assistance and a food allowance. This is fake. Latest Reels The Senate and the meanness of Alan Cayetano Even in his absence at the plenary session, the meanness of Cayetano is palpable. His ultimate {goal is obvious: Save Sara Duterte from conviction even if that meant destroying the institution of the Senate and the country. In alliance with Global Investigative 2 Journalism Network Who is the NPA enabler (daw)? At the very least, the red tag of Risa Hontiveros is insane. There never has been any judicial or official evidence that connects Hontiveros with the CPP or the NPA. Those who study the phenomenon of political spectra in facts consistently aligned with center right and administration policies rather than the political left her as Y#NDI Meedan : Bullit's Eye F \u2018Shit happens\u201d at the Senate Learning Corner Know how you can fight misinformation and disinformation. Learn more Sections News SANDATAHANG DAHAS \u00a9 Disturbing incidents of violence by state agents Urgent push for child safety in an increasingly dangerous digital world: Inside the national ISP summit 2026 Peter Haynes is Duterte's new ICC lawyer ICC orders disclosure of Duterte's new counsel, grants Kaufman's withdrawal Elections FACT CHECK: \u2018Unanimous\u2019 PNP, AFP vote for pro-Duterte senators NEEDS CONTEXT FACT CHECK: 1.4 milyon, HINDI 17 milyong botante, ang may sobrang boto sa mga senador FACT SHEET: From Manila to The Hague and Can Duterte swing it? The 2025 Party-List election winners UWYERAF Media Ownership Monitor - The news that you get depends on who owns the media. more The ICC Probe Duterte won't attend first status conference 