{"_key": "vdare", "source_key": "vdare", "filename": "Vdare.png", "image_file": "Vdare.png", "ok": true, "feature_schema": "nollm_raw12_v3_lx9_v8", "nollm_features": {"s004_sensational_verbs": 1.0234, "s008_neutral_headlines": -0.5753, "s010_scare_quotes": 4.0, "s023_no_owner_identified": 0.0, "s072_loaded_category_tags": 2.0, "s076_conspiracy_tropes": 0.0, "s078_absolutist_framing": 5.0, "s085_standard_sections": 4.0, "s097_suspicious_url": 0.0, "story_block_count": 6.0, "hero_image_area_frac": 0.0, "thumbnail_size_uniformity": 0.8546, "s060_templated_imagery": 0.4999, "largest_face_area_frac": 0.00165, "small_face_count": 3.0, "s066_cluttered_blog_look": 0.0503, "inter_story_whitespace_frac": 0.362, "content_column_count": "2", "side_margin_frac": 0.434, "header_band_height_frac": 0.138, "logo_centered": 1.0, "accent_hue": "red", "accent_color_count": 1.77, "background_brightness": "white", "s067_alarmist_colors": 0.0097, "page_scroll_length": "medium", "nav_item_count": 45.0, "footer_link_count": 107.0, "cta_button_count": 0.0, "newsletter_box_count": 0.0, "social_icon_count": 0.0, "search_box_present": 0.0, "weather_widget_present": 0.0, "account_button_present": 0.0, "category_badge_count": 0.0, "mean_headline_word_count": 5.0, "headline_size_variance": 0.0747, "page_text_density": "dense", "timestamp_count": 14.0, "allcaps_token_frac": 0.0886, "number_token_frac": 0.0551, "city_or_county_in_name": 0.0, "lx_ideology_identity_per100": 0.2924, "lx_attribution_per100": 0.0, "lx_timestamp_per100": 1.3645, "lx_loaded_outgroup_per100": 0.3899, "lx_health_scare_per100": 0.0, "lx_question_style_per100": 3.5088, "lx_culture_war_per100": 1.1696, "lx_market_money_per100": 0.1949, "lx_local_civic_per100": 0.9747}, "ocr_text": "Support VDARE's Legal Defense Fund! Support VDARE's Legal Defense Fund! \u2018The New York Attorney General has crippled VDARE with onerous subpoena demands. Now, more than ever, we need your support to fight back against this continuing lawfare. To make a tax deductible donation by mail, please use the following address + The VDARE Foundation + PO Box 211 + Litchfield, CT 06759 Visit our campaign page to contribute to our defense fund. Every donation helps us continue our mission and stand firm against these pressures. Stand with us, stand for free speech! 10:04 PM - Jul 23, 2024 1} 42K \u2014@ Reply PD Copy tink 452 replies \u2018Someone I know recently lost his daughter. She was exactly the same age as my son Alexander, and in fact we have pictures of them together as babies. Needless to say, losing VDARE.com is absolutely nothing compared to that. But it still hurts. Very soon, the VDARE.com website will be suspended. We are currently unsure for how long the archives will remain accessible, or even if they will be accessible at all (We do think that our social media, however, will still function). So my role here has been destroyed. After 25 years, I am resigning as Editor of \\VDARE.com and from the VDARE.com Foundation board, My wife Lydia will continue for now as President of the VDARE Foundation, handling the administrative details of winding down\u2014and, of course, paying lawyers. One bright spot: Read More >> BY LYDIA BRIMELOW VDARE.com vs. Cancel Culture - My Story My husband, VDARE.com Editor Peter Brimelow, has described, in his resignation announcement above, the lethal lawfare waged against us by New York State Attorney General Letitia James. But Peter also mentioned other interlocking issues that are also contributing to our decision to suspend. Here I want to put on the record, because I lived it personally, the role of Cancel Culture in the demise of VDARE.com. My role as President of the VDARE Foundation perforce became, not fundraising, but developing strategies to survive Cancel Culture. It is my sense that our little organization has been targeted more harshly than almost any other. We are genuinely puzzled as to why. Essentially, we've just been advocating what President Trump endorsed in his epochal August 15, 2015, Immigration Statement . What's wrong with that? Nevertheless, Cancel Culture is a key reason it has become impossible for VDARE Foundation to continue our main project, the VDARE.com website. My bitter task here is to explain that, and to describe what I have done to fight it off as long as possible. Read More >> LATEST BY JAMES FULFORD ON 07/26/2024 a FRAUD ALERT: VDARE.Com Is NOT Soliciting ves Crypto Donations By Email nor sachin pte dematons atte tine 7 Please email Ibrimelow@vdare.com if you see any emails \u2018nd1SNOT from VDARE. like this... Uhisscam please lt metnow and raport tat Read more >> BBY JAMES FULFORD ON 07/24/2028 Martin Peretz, Trump, And The \u201cCentral Park Five\u201d Martin Peretz has written a book called The Controversialist: Arguments with Everyone, Left Right and Center, dealing with his life, and here he is talking about New York in the late 80s: And the lowe. CONTROVERSIALIST Read more >> BY STEVE SAILER ON 07/24/2024 Sailer In TakiMag: \u201cRed Scare\": What's The Matter With Economists? Earlier, by Pat Buchanan: They WERE Communists\u2014Dalton Trumbo Had It Coming From my new column in Taki's Magazine: Red ScareSteve Sailer July 24, 2024 1 considered writing about presidential politics... Read more >> \u2018BY JOHN DERBYSHIRE ON 07/21/2024 Demography Is Destiny All Over The World I talk about demography a lot on VDARE.com, mainly about the decline in fertility rates all over the civilized world. There are also demographic issues at the other end of the age range, though: . Read more >> BBY JOHN DERBYSHIRE ON 07/21/2024 They Want Your Children Monday this week California Governor Gavin Newsom signed into state law a new act that bans school districts from notifying parents if their child, when at school, presents as a different sex from the Read more >> \u2018THEY WANT YOUR CHILDREN BBY JAMES FULFORD ON 07/21/2026 No, Ta-Nehisi Coates's Book Isn't One Of The Best Of The 21st Century\u2014For The Rest It's Too Soon To Tell \u2018At about the 20th century's three-quarter mark, say about 1973, I read Christopher Morley\u2019s The Haunted Bookshop, probably by borrowing a physical copy from the public library. The Haunted Bookshop (yo. Read more >> BBY FEDERALE ON 07/21/2024 mee More On The Lies That Guard The Ration cour date now updowd worst\u201d Tr migration Court Amnesty And Open Borders eases apened 675 closed FY 2024 Mogeom coe pene The latest statistics are out for the Executive Office For 1 eS ropresentad he odered deported Immigration Review (EOIR), the administrative immigration court. The June numbers confirm that the \u2018Treason Bar and open borders advocates are ... Read more >> on BY JOHN DERBYSHIRE ON 07/20/2024 en JOHN DERBYSHIRE: Thinking About Poli - Assassinations (Remember Percival v. Bellingham?) ical [Adapted from the latest Radio Derb, now available exclusively on VDARE.com] Shall I always remember where I was and what I was doing when I got the news CCHineseStLUNGT SHIN about the Trump assassination attempt last Satu. WITHIN HOURS OF SHOOTING Read more >> BY JOHN DERBYSHIRE ON 07/20/2024 The Long Slow Biden Slide So: that\u2019s the shock and the spectacle. What's the suspense? The suspense is of course all on the other side, the side where the Democratic Party dwells. Will Joe Biden run for a second term in Novembe... Read more >> BY JOHN DERBYSHIRE ON 07/19/2024 JOHN DERBYSHIRE: Blowhard Gives Boring Speech, But Hard Not To Catch RNC Enthusiasm [Adapted from the latest Radio Derb, now available exclusively on VDARE.com] Yes, the Republican Party's National Convention in Milwaukee, Monday through Thursday was quite a spectacle. To begin at the. Read more >> MORE.. POPULAR TAGS 1S Gun Control NOt reporting . Anti-White Hate Crimes Minor Diversity Is Strength ponaie trump insurgency Var On Chris FACE wit", "ocr_text_len": 6025}
