{"_key": "wehuntedthemammoth", "source_key": "wehuntedthemammoth", "filename": "We_Hunted_the_Mammoth.png", "image_file": "We_Hunted_the_Mammoth.png", "ok": true, "feature_schema": "nollm_raw12_v3_lx9_v8", "nollm_features": {"s004_sensational_verbs": 0.2148, "s008_neutral_headlines": -0.1207, "s010_scare_quotes": 3.0, "s023_no_owner_identified": 1.0, "s072_loaded_category_tags": 1.0, "s076_conspiracy_tropes": 0.0, "s078_absolutist_framing": 2.0, "s085_standard_sections": 0.0, "s097_suspicious_url": 0.0, "story_block_count": 16.0, "hero_image_area_frac": 0.00503, "thumbnail_size_uniformity": 0.7514, "s060_templated_imagery": 0.408, "largest_face_area_frac": 0.00279, "small_face_count": 16.0, "s066_cluttered_blog_look": 0.0451, "inter_story_whitespace_frac": 0.4282, "content_column_count": "3plus", "side_margin_frac": 0.566, "header_band_height_frac": 0.0058, "logo_centered": 0.0, "accent_hue": "orange", "accent_color_count": 1.5918, "background_brightness": "white", "s067_alarmist_colors": 0.0308, "page_scroll_length": "long", "nav_item_count": 28.0, "footer_link_count": 127.0, "cta_button_count": 3.0, "newsletter_box_count": 2.0, "social_icon_count": 2.0, "search_box_present": 0.0, "weather_widget_present": 0.0, "account_button_present": 0.0, "category_badge_count": 3.0, "mean_headline_word_count": 6.2, "headline_size_variance": 0.1742, "page_text_density": "dense", "timestamp_count": 6.0, "allcaps_token_frac": 0.0293, "number_token_frac": 0.0185, "city_or_county_in_name": 0.0, "lx_ideology_identity_per100": 0.2148, "lx_attribution_per100": 0.0215, "lx_timestamp_per100": 0.6445, "lx_loaded_outgroup_per100": 0.1074, "lx_health_scare_per100": 0.0, "lx_question_style_per100": 5.478, "lx_culture_war_per100": 0.1074, "lx_market_money_per100": 0.1074, "lx_local_civic_per100": 0.2148}, "ocr_text": "\u2018About WHTM About David Futrelle Comments Policy Support the Mammoth! WHTM on YouTube Writing Coaching ANNOUNCEMENTS I've started a new thing called BROTOPIANS that you want to read 2 ByDavid Futrelle 3 January 7,2026 [) 5 Comments Hey what's up how\u2019s it goin? I've got a big announcement, which is that I've started a NEW THING, a sort of blog/newsletter thing on Ghost that I call BROTOPIANS. It\u2019s about, well, brotopians, which is my name for a new species of techbro with utopian dreams, which tend to be pretty dystopian for the rest of us. Basically 've found a new breed of terrible men to make fun of. The new blog/newsletter will cover said brotopians, their wild dreams of perfect lives and perfect worlds (for them anyway) and the regular squashing of these dreams by reality. | will tak about everything from seasteading and failed charter cities to the weird diets of life-extensionists. | will talk about Effective Altruism and Effective Accelerationism and why they are not at all the same thing. We'll do peptide raves. | will explore why pretty much all of these techie utopians tend to be men, though that may become obvious after reading a post or two. The first post is up it's kind of an intro thing ~ so go check it out! ~David ANNOUNCEMENTS A Mammoth farewell 2 ByDavid Futrelle 3 September21,2025 C57 Comments \u2018So | have something of a sad announcement to make today, one that Ive been putting off posting. rm not going to be able to continue with this blog. | need to make a living and unfortunately the level of engagement with my latest posts has not been enough to make that possible. | intend to maintain the blog as a We Hunted the Mammoth archive, and will periodically put up posts highlighting some of the best stuff that has appeared here over the many years of Mammoth\u2019 existence. And I plan on dropping in from time to time with brief commentaries and pointers to other pieces | write, but this will be more occasional than regular. | want to thank everyone who has contributed to this blog over the course of its run. And not just those who have donated money (but huge thanks to all of you!) but also those who've contributed with artistic and technical help \u2018and by making the comments here so vibrant. In case you're wondering, you all have posted more than 800,000 (\") comments here over the years. {'m proud of this blog, which began chronicling and mocking the growing \u2018manosphere long before most people had any idea what it was, and which helped to shape the discourse about it as it metastasized into the monster it is today. When | began | really had no idea what | was getting into, much less that the blog would last as long or get as much attention as it did. I've learned a lot doing Mammoth, and a lot of that I learned from you all, especially those regular posters whose comments further illuminated the issues under discussion, and who were willing to call me out when I went wrong. 'm glad | got to know you. {'m grateful to those who have continued to donate even while | wasn't putting up new material, and | hope that some of you will keep on donating to help pay for the not inconsiderable costs of hosting the blog and its massive database of posts and comments, Again, thanks to all of you; you were the ones who made this blog possible. David Futrelle Follow me on Bluesky or Mastodon. Contact me at afutrelle at gmail dot com. We Hunted the Mammoth depends on support from you to remain online. So please donate here if you can, or on Venmo! ARE YOUA WRITER PUTRELLE An initial half-hour writing consultation is FREE. Click for details. ANNOUNCEMENTS Where I've been 2 ByDavid Futrelle. 3 July 28,2025) 88Comments Hey it\u2019s my cats when they were kittens! So, just a quick and long-overdue note to let you know what is going on with \u2018me and why I haven't posted in such a long time. Basically, 'm neck-deep in a big project with a rather urgent deadline and | just haven't had time to focus \u2018on the blog. | will get back to it as soon as I can, but m not quite sure yet when that will be. My apologies! And Ill try to keep you all updated in a \u2018somewhat more timely fashion as this thing progresses. Follow me on Bluesky or Mastodon, Send tips to dfutrelle at gmail dot com. We Hunted the Mammoth depends on support from you to survive. So please donate here if you can, or on Venmo! WRITER FEELING STUCK? wrITiNG COACH \u2018An initial half-hour writing consultation is FREE. Click for details. [ACTUAL ACTIVISM ACTUAL GENOCIDE ANTIFEMINIST WOMEN CONCERN TROLLS Claire Lehmann calls the waahmbulance about women who protest stuff 2 ByDavid Futrelle 3 July 1,2025 2) 86 Comments We Hunted the Mammoth relies on your donations to fund its beta male lifestyle. Please drop a few bucks here or here if you can! Claire Lehmann wants you to know that something is very wrong with young women today. No, not because they'e suffering from unprecedented rates of anxiety and depression, or facing assaults on their reproductive freedom, or <drowning in student debt while the planet burns. No, the \u201cwoke\"-obsessed antifeminist is concerned because these terrible gals are banging drums in libraries and throwing soup at (protective glass in front of) famous artworks to protest climate collapse and genocide. Q", "ocr_text_len": 5260}
