ted is to improve our website's functionality and performance, and. enhance and customise your experience with us. Some cookies are necessary to use our website and can't be switched off (Necessary Cookies\") but other cookies used for a range of purposes like marketing, analytics and statistics are not essential, You have the choice to opt-in and click on one of these buttons \u201cAccept All cookies\", \u201cReject All cookies\" or \u201cManage My Choices\" to decide clearly which non-essential cookies you want to select. By clicking \u201cReject All cookies\" {you willbe able to access our website however your experience may be impacted, Please read our for full details. [Manage my choices MMU team etaiea \u2018Accept all cookies SOLAR POWER SHINES WHEN RIVERS REST ese engineer's. 1nd is helping remote communities build 2 leaner future lar training in FROM THE ARCTIC TO MEXICO - STORIES OF SUCCESS From cleaner shipping fuel to more monarch butterfl ries for people and the INVESTING IN A HEALTHY PLANET We rely on a healthy planet forthe food, water, and air we \u2018need. WWF s pioneering Landscape Finance\u2014a new strategy tounlock billions in global investment, ensuring financial institutions and local communities work together to secure the worlds most critical ecosystems WILDLIFE POPULATIONS PLUMMET BY 73% devastating collapse in average wildlife populations since 1970 is revealed by WWF's flagship Living Planet Report. Ecosystems are nearing collapse and we are close to irreversible tipping points. CLIMATE AND ENERGY FINANCE ; OUR AMBITION The world has changed \\Wiilfe has halved in less than a generation. Natural habitats are being put under increasing pressure. And climate change Is leading us into uncharted territory But people have changed too. Theyre more aware ofthe threat to essentials like food, water and clean air. Theyre more ambitious, more innovative. And theyre backed by a growing number of corporations. Working to sustain the natural world for the benefit of people and nature Discover Act Latest About WWF Donate to WWE Climate & Energy Take Action Finance Partner with WWE Food Plastic Pollution Treaty Forests Freshwater Oceans wildlife People & conservation Knowledge Hub Contact ofthe Ombudsperson Speak up-W Using & Sharing Site Content Privacy \\WWE\u00ae and \u00a91986 Panda Symbol are owned by WWF. All rights reserved", "ocr_text_len": 2512}
