Culture Must Change Dear Reader, Greetings to you and thank you for taking the time to read this long but important letter. | am a deeply concerned Minister MESSAGE _\u00b0f the Gospel based in Scotland, UK. | am writing this letter with a heavy heart, but out of responsibility and necessity. | have stood by on the sidelines ... [Read more...] Child Abuse and Child Molestation with Masonic Affiliations \u2018March 11, 2026 by Nyisha Hinton \u2014 Leave a Comment \u2018The topic of child abuse and child molestation can be an unsettling, uncomfortable conversation. Numerous survivors (including male victims) are starting to speak out more than ever: social media has become more than just gaining followers and finding that old high school buddy. There are an array of social issues in our world as we navigate through everyday .. [Read more..] Woe unto the inhabitants of the earth! Gog and Magog \u2018March 6,2026 by Mena Lee Jones \u2014 1 Comment Prophetic Word 3/6/2026 This morning the Lord woke me up by saying; \"A storm is coming...a storm that the world has never seen. Prophetic Word 3/6/2026 This morning the Lord woke me up by saying; \u201cA storm Is coming... storm that the world has never seen. Woe unto the Inhabitants of the earth! Tell My children to keep their eyes on Me; fix your gaze upon Me and do not .. [Read more...] Prophecy Update: 2026 ~ Watch & Pray That Ye May Be Counted Worthy to Escape These Things to Come.. In this video (Posted 2/3/26), Prophetess Mena brings a heavy word to the Body of Christ and those who are struggling in their walk with the Lord. She shares that the time of darkness has begun. In a dream given to Prophetess Mena, she was looking out of a window during the black of night and saw (even) blacker clouds rolling in. The Lord spoke and said; \"A storm is... [Read more..] The Bait of Satan - Unforgiveness [November 18,2025 by John Bevere ~ 3 Comments lam excited about what the Lord has put in my heart to share with you. It's actually a message that | wrote a book on almost 30 years ago, and | feel that today it is more of a prophetic word for right now than it was then. | truly believe this is what the Holy Spirit wants me to speak to you. | don't want this to just be a message; | want to see your life change [Read more...] I heard the Lord say, \u2018Ready, Set, Slipstream! Recently | heard the Lord say, \u2018Ready, Set, Slipstream When the Lord spoke these words | could see a steam train leaving a station. The sound of the whistle was loud and it was the move into a new movement with the Holy Spirit. It was the closing of one chapter and the opening of a new \u2018one. The sense surrounded me in this encounter of \u2018commissioning\u2019. It [Read more... was the sound The Coming of the Greatest Outpouring, Revival, Spiritual Awakening, and Mass Evangelism Ever [November 17,2025 by Mike Thompson ~ 2 Comments Hello, spiritual prayer warriors. | want to talk to you about authority and glory. The anointing of the Spirit of God is strongly present as | share this. | have received a number of visions, the most recent being on October 14th, 2025, where the Lord revealed the significant coming of His rainbow glory to the earth, | want to discuss the power and meaning Of this imminent ... [Read more... Nurse Dies goes to Hell and Experiences Horrific Acts by Demons \"November 17,2025 by James Bailey ~ Leave a Comment In the 66-minute video shown at the bottom of this post, which was published on August 19, 2025, Bridgette Candace shares her testimony of dying and going to hell. Learn more about Bridgette at her website. The remainder of this post is her story in her own words. Bridgette's Background: Implantation of Fear from Early Childhood Attacks My earliest memories involve [Read more...] Huge Warning Dream and Message: Fallen Angels, UFOs, Revelation 12 and 3 Heavens November 14,2025 by Elizabeth Marie ~ 2 Comments pixabay.com A couple of weeks ago, | was talking to a family member about the \u2018UFO Phenomena\u2019 that has been exploding all over the earth in the last year. He Is very knowledgable about the subject as he \u2018deep dives; into the latest research and theories. This is a conversation that we often have... as he shares what he has learned... and it is always very interesting. |. [Read more... Knowing the Terror of The Lord, We Persuade Men! The book of 2 Corinthians 5:9-11 provides a powerful exhortation: \u201cTherefore we make it our aim, whether present or absent, to be well pleasing to Him [the Lord Jesus Christ] Our primary purpose and life's goal, the Apostle Paul declares, must be to please God, The inevitability of Judgment This pursuit is I, \u201cfor we must all appear before the judgment seat of .. [Read essenti more..] An Encounter That Will Change Your Life In November of 2021 I had one of the most unexpected and transforming encounters of my life. I needed to remind myself of this encounter and felt the Spirit say to post it again. | was in our Sunday worship service in downtown Portland, Oregon, and I found myself being drawn into a place (in the spirit) that | had never been before\u2014 at least not like this. | was no longer in .. [Read more... The Piercing is but Preparation for His Power \"November 12, 2025 by Wanda Alger ~ Leave a Comment Iwas processing with a group of intercessors last night and several were noting how many believers are facing tough spiritual battles in recent weeks. Sensing increased attacks on our health, our relationships, and our faith, we went to prayer. | then had a vision of Jesus holding a new wineskin in His hand. But it wasn't finished. He was sewing this new leather pouch by ... [Read more...] I heard the Lord say, \u2018This week, look for the supernatural signs of the redeeming of time! \u2018November 10,2025 by Lana Vawser \u2014 1. Comment heard the Lord say, \u2018This week, look for the supernatural signs of the redeeming of time. As the Lord spoke these words, | could feel such a strong sense of the heart of the Lord bringing forth restoration, recompense and increase. As | leaned into the Lord and listened, | began to see clouds parting. There was a new day of clarity and a new day of restoration that was ... [Read more... WHAT THE LORD SHOW ME: Two Kings. Two Systems... One Antichrist November 5,2025 by Elizabeth Marie ~ Leave @ Comment The LORD has been unveiling, from HIS WORD, further understanding of the times that we are in. When reading prophecy from the Revelation 17 we can see that there are two opposing systems: the BEAST SYSTEM the BABYLON THE GREAT SYSTEM These two \u2018SYSTEMS\u2019 work together, though they are enemies. Satan controls them both, and uses them to accomplish his last great feats [Read more...] I heard the Lord speaking to many daughters of God, \u2018This week chapters will close and new commissionings will begin! November 2,2025 by Lana Vawser ~ 7 Comments Today | heard the Lord speaking to many daughters of God, \u201cThis week chapters will close and new commissionings will begin\u2019 As the Lord spoke these words | could feel such an intense weight of His presence in bringing closure and finality to chapters in many lives of His daughters. As Heaned in and listened to the Lord, | heard two words thundering around [Read more..] Ever-Increasing Spiritual Warfare is Attacking Believers in CHRIST october 2, 2028 by Elizabeth Marie ~ 1 Comment Ihave been experiencing and seeing this year the \u2018ever-increasing\u2019 SPIRITUAL WARFARE that is attacking the believers in CHRIST. If you are walking closely with the LORD JESUS, | would not be surprised if you are also probably experiencing some pretty serious trials and tribulations! This is because of the times that we are living in.....the ENDTIMES. where MANY DOORS have [Read more...] I heard the Lord say, \u2018The winds of change are increasing. Lean in! Recently, | heard the Lord say, \u2018The winds of change are increasing. Lean. in! As | leaned int